(143251, 7147, 2123, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like the use of a patterned background or not, but the flower is lit nicely.  6 kathleenm</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like the use of a patterned background or not, but the flower is lit nicely.  6 kathleenm', '2002-10-21 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143252, 7147, 4648, '<td valign="top">Like the texture to the surface infront of the flower.  Flower looks 3 dimensional.  Good lighting effect and sharp picture.  I''m not a 10 giver so it hurts but I must give you one for this.</td>', 'Like the texture to the surface infront of the flower.  Flower looks 3 dimensional.  Good lighting effect and sharp picture.  I''m not a 10 giver so it hurts but I must give you one for this.', '2002-10-21 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143253, 7147, 4388, '<td valign="top">great idea an almost a great photo, the background reminds me of a shower door.</td>', 'great idea an almost a great photo, the background reminds me of a shower door.', '2002-10-21 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143254, 7147, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  The reflectionss from the background are a bit distracting from the flower.</td>', 'This is nice.  The reflectionss from the background are a bit distracting from the flower.', '2002-10-22 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143255, 7147, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like the flower but not the brown background, the color doesn''t look so good, not the specklyness.</td>', 'I like the flower but not the brown background, the color doesn''t look so good, not the specklyness.', '2002-10-22 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143256, 7147, 3724, '<td valign="top">am enjoying texture on the background....  and the gradation of the light on it.  It certianly provides  interesting contrast to the softer bloom.   The flower placement is problematic......   I could see tight cropping on the top and bottom as a solution to my preferences.  I love the half moon shape of the flower.  5</td>', 'am enjoying texture on the background....  and the gradation of the light on it.  It certianly provides  interesting contrast to the softer bloom.   The flower placement is problematic......   I could see tight cropping on the top and bottom as a solution to my preferences.  I love the half moon shape of the flower.  5', '2002-10-22 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143257, 7147, 3317, '<td valign="top">what kind of surface is that, it''s nice, abstract in that i can''t figure it out, looks like dark sandpaper. pretty, six for you.</td>', 'what kind of surface is that, it''s nice, abstract in that i can''t figure it out, looks like dark sandpaper. pretty, six for you.', '2002-10-22 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143258, 7147, 3575, '<td valign="top">I really like the background you used. I''m can''t tell what it is but the rough texture against the delicate flower is a very nice contrast. I like the pink and brown also. Good job.</td>', 'I really like the background you used. I''m can''t tell what it is but the rough texture against the delicate flower is a very nice contrast. I like the pink and brown also. Good job.', '2002-10-22 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143259, 7147, 2200, '<td valign="top">The texture of the background is too noisy. I like the lighting on the flower.</td>', 'The texture of the background is too noisy. I like the lighting on the flower.', '2002-10-22 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143260, 7147, 4162, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2002-10-22 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143261, 7147, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, good color and focus.  I like your choice of backgrounds, very nice.  Single light source obvious enough.  Interest is a tad low and I have no ideas how to add more punch, then again, I''m getting an average of 4, so who am I to judge/suggest that.  I''m willing to upgrade your score, from 7 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Very good photo, good color and focus.  I like your choice of backgrounds, very nice.  Single light source obvious enough.  Interest is a tad low and I have no ideas how to add more punch, then again, I''m getting an average of 4, so who am I to judge/suggest that.  I''m willing to upgrade your score, from 7 to 8.  Swash', '2002-10-24 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143262, 7147, 2221, '<td valign="top">I would have liked portrait format more. But that''s just personal taste, nothing I can backup with technical arguments. The photo seems a bit grainy which in this case does not work good. It weakens the colour. The lighting however has something dramatic, which I like. -stephan</td>', 'I would have liked portrait format more. But that''s just personal taste, nothing I can backup with technical arguments. The photo seems a bit grainy which in this case does not work good. It weakens the colour. The lighting however has something dramatic, which I like. -stephan', '2002-10-27 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143263, 7151, 4625, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Mapplethorpe. Nicely done.</td>', 'Reminds me of Mapplethorpe. Nicely done.', '2002-10-21 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143264, 7151, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo... very good work here... I think this composition could be even stronger if your subject was on the left side of the frame rather than the right since the light is coming in from the right... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent photo... very good work here... I think this composition could be even stronger if your subject was on the left side of the frame rather than the right since the light is coming in from the right... great work :) - setzler', '2002-10-21 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143265, 7151, 2853, '<td valign="top">perfect shut, AND PERFECT BODY!...  (may I have his phone #?  just kidding)...  ;) good luck!</td>', 'perfect shut, AND PERFECT BODY!...  (may I have his phone #?  just kidding)...  ;) good luck!', '2002-10-21 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143266, 7151, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting.  This is really well taken.  I''m not wild about the subject (would be better if it was Elizabeth Hurley) but this is well done.  - 9 - Inspzil</td>', 'Great use of lighting.  This is really well taken.  I''m not wild about the subject (would be better if it was Elizabeth Hurley) but this is well done.  - 9 - Inspzil', '2002-10-21 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143267, 7151, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, though it seems like it could be a bit sharper on his back.</td>', 'Nicely lit, though it seems like it could be a bit sharper on his back.', '2002-10-21 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143268, 7151, 3867, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Good use of light.  Very dramatic.  Looks like a Calvin Klein ad.  Very professional looking.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Good use of light.  Very dramatic.  Looks like a Calvin Klein ad.  Very professional looking.', '2002-10-21 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143269, 7151, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great lightning. Perfect exposure. One of two favourites this week. Well done! /carsten</td>', 'Great lightning. Perfect exposure. One of two favourites this week. Well done! /carsten', '2002-10-21 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143270, 7151, 4007, '<td valign="top">a nude... male?!?!? = ) Excelent negative spade.  The form of the body is shown wonderfully.  Great composition as well.  I like that no visable part of the body reaches the edge of the frame, and also that the head is not visable at all.  Beautiful (coming from a straight male at that). 8 wingy</td>', 'a nude... male?!?!? = ) Excelent negative spade.  The form of the body is shown wonderfully.  Great composition as well.  I like that no visable part of the body reaches the edge of the frame, and also that the head is not visable at all.  Beautiful (coming from a straight male at that). 8 wingy', '2002-10-21 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143271, 7151, 4564, '<td valign="top">well executed. classic. 6</td>', 'well executed. classic. 6', '2002-10-21 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143272, 7151, 4749, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used the light source the image could be a bit sharper</td>', 'I like the way you used the light source the image could be a bit sharper', '2002-10-21 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143273, 7151, 4648, '<td valign="top">An 8 on a porn web site but a 1 here.  Doesn''t belong here on a family web site.  I have to keep chasing my grandchildren out of the room.</td>', 'An 8 on a porn web site but a 1 here.  Doesn''t belong here on a family web site.  I have to keep chasing my grandchildren out of the room.', '2002-10-21 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143274, 7151, 4615, '<td valign="top">could have been a beautiful picture, the effect of the little on the upperback muscles is interesting and dramatic, but for somereason the over all effect is wakward, making his bttocks unnaturally pronounced as if his posture is extremelybad .  If you look at it the right way, you can see a gapping mouthed demon face in his back.</td>', 'could have been a beautiful picture, the effect of the little on the upperback muscles is interesting and dramatic, but for somereason the over all effect is wakward, making his bttocks unnaturally pronounced as if his posture is extremelybad .  If you look at it the right way, you can see a gapping mouthed demon face in his back.', '2002-10-22 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143275, 7151, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love your your use of negative space to really accentuate the lighting and composition. lhall</td>', 'Great shot.  I love your your use of negative space to really accentuate the lighting and composition. lhall', '2002-10-22 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143276, 7151, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice pose. Very nice use of lighting. Focus seems soft and it bothers me to see some background. I would prefer it to be all black. ~indigo997</td>', 'Nice pose. Very nice use of lighting. Focus seems soft and it bothers me to see some background. I would prefer it to be all black. ~indigo997', '2002-10-22 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
