(143281, 7151, 3965, '<td valign="top">Nice outline, great lighting on the curves.  I like how you cannot see where his front ends and the background begins.  Also, on a more serious note, nice buns.</td>', 'Nice outline, great lighting on the curves.  I like how you cannot see where his front ends and the background begins.  Also, on a more serious note, nice buns.', '2002-10-23 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
