(143365, 7160, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well that''s really interesting. Can''t say I''ve ever seen one of these before.  I feel this meets the challenge well, however I think that the lighting near the "ball" might be a bit harsh on the table.  The lighting on the hip prosthesis its self is great, just the glare from the table is harsh.  Angle and framing/cropping are nice.  And you focus is great.  I have to admire that, as it was the hardest part of the challenge for me.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Well that''s really interesting. Can''t say I''ve ever seen one of these before.  I feel this meets the challenge well, however I think that the lighting near the "ball" might be a bit harsh on the table.  The lighting on the hip prosthesis its self is great, just the glare from the table is harsh.  Angle and framing/cropping are nice.  And you focus is great.  I have to admire that, as it was the hardest part of the challenge for me.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
