(143380, 7161, 4078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo; the only question is whether it violates the "single light source" requirement.  After all, the starburst on the computer is actually important to this photo, and not merely an incidental second light.  On the other hand, it seems to be part of the photo, rather than a source of light.</td>', 'Beautiful photo; the only question is whether it violates the "single light source" requirement.  After all, the starburst on the computer is actually important to this photo, and not merely an incidental second light.  On the other hand, it seems to be part of the photo, rather than a source of light.', '2002-10-21 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143381, 7161, 2764, '<td valign="top">could be brighter</td>', 'could be brighter', '2002-10-21 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
