(143385, 7161, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the blue glow. The pen adds a nice touch as well.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the blue glow. The pen adds a nice touch as well.', '2002-10-22 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143386, 7161, 2716, '<td valign="top">Neat.  Keep up the good work. Nice composition. 8</td>', 'Neat.  Keep up the good work. Nice composition. 8', '2002-10-22 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143387, 7161, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very simular to the one with the light pen.  Get the feeling I should be something at the top of the bok.  Can only get a slight hint something is there.  If intentional can''t make it out.  If unintentional detract from over all flow.  Like the large border on book, makes to look like studying.  I still like the overall picture.</td>', 'Very simular to the one with the light pen.  Get the feeling I should be something at the top of the bok.  Can only get a slight hint something is there.  If intentional can''t make it out.  If unintentional detract from over all flow.  Like the large border on book, makes to look like studying.  I still like the overall picture.', '2002-10-24 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143388, 7161, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Just the smallest vision of the monitor lets us see what the light source is but any more monitor would have taken away from the beauty of the shot. It''s hard for me to see but it looks like eye glasses just above the book. This monitor shows everything a little darker than my monitor at home. I like that the text is soft so that you can''t make out any words. Soft, Beautiful! Technically flawless - I love it! joanns (10)</td>', 'Wonderful! Just the smallest vision of the monitor lets us see what the light source is but any more monitor would have taken away from the beauty of the shot. It''s hard for me to see but it looks like eye glasses just above the book. This monitor shows everything a little darker than my monitor at home. I like that the text is soft so that you can''t make out any words. Soft, Beautiful! Technically flawless - I love it! joanns (10)', '2002-10-24 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143389, 7161, 4055, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit - good toneality here! I had probably made it a little less blue, I think, but I´m not 100% sure. Like it very much anyway. /carsten</td>', 'Nicely lit - good toneality here! I had probably made it a little less blue, I think, but I´m not 100% sure. Like it very much anyway. /carsten', '2002-10-25 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
