(143739, 7198, 2667, '<td valign="top">dramatic pose and I feel the grainy texture adds to the drama. if light source was shone more from above I think the drama would have been increased and the darkest shadows would be below the subject; anchoring him, while the whole upper part of the body was highlighted. IMO would have made your composition stronger.</td>', 'dramatic pose and I feel the grainy texture adds to the drama. if light source was shone more from above I think the drama would have been increased and the darkest shadows would be below the subject; anchoring him, while the whole upper part of the body was highlighted. IMO would have made your composition stronger.', '2002-10-22 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143740, 7198, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think some resolution was lost at a higher ISO, although I''m no expert.  I don''t care for the pose a whole lot.  I don''t think anything was to gain from the girl being shirtless.  The lighting isn''t too bad.  I think the biggest problem is the grainy texture.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I think some resolution was lost at a higher ISO, although I''m no expert.  I don''t care for the pose a whole lot.  I don''t think anything was to gain from the girl being shirtless.  The lighting isn''t too bad.  I think the biggest problem is the grainy texture.  - Inspzil', '2002-10-22 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143741, 7198, 4402, '<td valign="top">The picture could have been sharper.  It does not make since to me why his face is nothing but hair.  I don''t understand why the picture is mostly one color.  You are trying to tell me something but I don''t know what it is.</td>', 'The picture could have been sharper.  It does not make since to me why his face is nothing but hair.  I don''t understand why the picture is mostly one color.  You are trying to tell me something but I don''t know what it is.', '2002-10-24 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
