(143813, 7199, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a stunning shot - what with various last minute crises last week I didnt have the chance to even look through the entries let alone vote - but I know this would have been a 10 from me.<br/>The shafts of light come across as good dreams breaking through the darkness don''t they?<br/>Congrats on first place!</td>', 'Wow this is a stunning shot - what with various last minute crises last week I didnt have the chance to even look through the entries let alone vote - but I know this would have been a 10 from me.The shafts of light come across as good dreams breaking through the darkness don''t they?Congrats on first place!', '2002-10-28 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
