(143823, 7200, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!!  No pun intended.  Beautiful picture.  Could tell that you may have had problems with focus.  Outside of the challenge, I wonder if better lighting would have helped.</td>', 'Very nice composition!!  No pun intended.  Beautiful picture.  Could tell that you may have had problems with focus.  Outside of the challenge, I wonder if better lighting would have helped.', '2002-10-21 04:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
