(143907, 7205, 3080, '<td valign="top">Is the glass broken?  If not, the lighting kind of makes it look that way.  Pretty cool actually.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice, and the lighting is great.  I really like the way it looks on the glass.  there is a small bright spot on the upper left of the orange.  I am asuming by the color that it is an orange, if it''s a lemon, then something went wrong there. lol  Focus is perfect.  Nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Is the glass broken?  If not, the lighting kind of makes it look that way.  Pretty cool actually.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice, and the lighting is great.  I really like the way it looks on the glass.  there is a small bright spot on the upper left of the orange.  I am asuming by the color that it is an orange, if it''s a lemon, then something went wrong there. lol  Focus is perfect.  Nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
