(143953, 7209, 917, '<td valign="top">I''d lose the logo in the bottom left (posibbly by cropping closer on the left and bottom), and Id get the eye in sharper focus. Its really good that one eye socket appears empty.</td>', 'I''d lose the logo in the bottom left (posibbly by cropping closer on the left and bottom), and Id get the eye in sharper focus. Its really good that one eye socket appears empty.', '2002-10-24 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143954, 7209, 3540, '<td valign="top">If you don''t mind I''m going to move up your score and leave a comment.  This is a lot deeper photo than I originally gave it credit for.  I can''t honestly remember voting on it.  But the shadows are dramatic, the soft focus works well with this picture and the choice of B&amp;W was very sound, almost essential with this type of shot.  I have the Phantom of the Opera in mind looking at it.  I wish the crop wasn''t so tight though se we could see a little more mask/head.  I think it might shift focus to the person wearing the mask as opposed to the mask itself.  Very nice shot though.  So you go up 2 notches to 7.  - Inspzil</td>', 'If you don''t mind I''m going to move up your score and leave a comment.  This is a lot deeper photo than I originally gave it credit for.  I can''t honestly remember voting on it.  But the shadows are dramatic, the soft focus works well with this picture and the choice of B&W was very sound, almost essential with this type of shot.  I have the Phantom of the Opera in mind looking at it.  I wish the crop wasn''t so tight though se we could see a little more mask/head.  I think it might shift focus to the person wearing the mask as opposed to the mask itself.  Very nice shot though.  So you go up 2 notches to 7.  - Inspzil', '2002-10-26 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143955, 7209, 3023, '<td valign="top">Nice, would like to print it and hang it on the wall! :)</td>', 'Nice, would like to print it and hang it on the wall! :)', '2002-10-26 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143956, 7209, 2223, '<td valign="top">scary!</td>', 'scary!', '2002-10-26 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143957, 7209, 3002, '<td valign="top">scary!</td>', 'scary!', '2002-10-27 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143958, 7209, 1826, '<td valign="top">I think this would be stronger without that symbol in the lower left corner- just my opinion.</td>', 'I think this would be stronger without that symbol in the lower left corner- just my opinion.', '2002-10-27 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143959, 7210, 2780, '<td valign="top">...would smell just as sweet.<br/>Very nice photo, I like the way only the rose head is in light, the red looks good against the black background.<br/>8 - Konador</td>', '...would smell just as sweet.Very nice photo, I like the way only the rose head is in light, the red looks good against the black background.8 - Konador', '2002-10-21 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143960, 7210, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition... I think the light on the rose is just a little weak.... I littler stronger light would be great here... good shot :) - setzler</td>', 'Very nice composition... I think the light on the rose is just a little weak.... I littler stronger light would be great here... good shot :) - setzler', '2002-10-21 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143961, 7210, 4297, '<td valign="top">a tad too dark.</td>', 'a tad too dark.', '2002-10-21 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143962, 7210, 917, '<td valign="top">The negative space is a bit gratuitous, the rose points out of the frame too. There are two lines off of the rose, apparently a leaf edge and the stem, they should be brought into the composition or eliminated.</td>', 'The negative space is a bit gratuitous, the rose points out of the frame too. There are two lines off of the rose, apparently a leaf edge and the stem, they should be brought into the composition or eliminated.', '2002-10-21 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143963, 7210, 2764, '<td valign="top">too dark - is it my monitor?</td>', 'too dark - is it my monitor?', '2002-10-21 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143964, 7210, 4564, '<td valign="top">well framed. great color contrast- red and black. lovely. nice use of the black.  well executed but missing that little something. 6/10</td>', 'well framed. great color contrast- red and black. lovely. nice use of the black.  well executed but missing that little something. 6/10', '2002-10-21 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143965, 7210, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space here. karmat</td>', 'I like the use of negative space here. karmat', '2002-10-21 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143966, 7210, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the water drops effect.  Feel others will complain of the background but I like the simplicity of it all.  The thumbnail doesn''t do it justice.  Maybe just a smidge lighter.</td>', 'Love the water drops effect.  Feel others will complain of the background but I like the simplicity of it all.  The thumbnail doesn''t do it justice.  Maybe just a smidge lighter.', '2002-10-21 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
