(143968, 7210, 4411, '<td valign="top">Good, but the lighting doesn''t scream ''dramatic'' at me. The rose could do to be bigger so we could see the water drops properly. I still like it though.</td>', 'Good, but the lighting doesn''t scream ''dramatic'' at me. The rose could do to be bigger so we could see the water drops properly. I still like it though.', '2002-10-24 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
