(143976, 7211, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is but don''t like it.  Appears to be a mask of some sort.  Would have been better with a real person.  Good shot and good light but bad subject and eye appeal.</td>', 'Don''t know what it is but don''t like it.  Appears to be a mask of some sort.  Would have been better with a real person.  Good shot and good light but bad subject and eye appeal.', '2002-10-23 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
