(143987, 7212, 1779, '<td valign="top">the vase is beautiful. why didn''t you use just the base with the black background? try seeing it withou the floor ann it looks way better, weloll IMO, that is  : )</td>', 'the vase is beautiful. why didn''t you use just the base with the black background? try seeing it withou the floor ann it looks way better, weloll IMO, that is  : )', '2002-10-22 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
