(143991, 7212, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the soft green glow, the shadow and light circle, and the negative space for effect.  Good shot. 7 wingy</td>', 'I like the soft green glow, the shadow and light circle, and the negative space for effect.  Good shot. 7 wingy', '2002-10-24 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143992, 7212, 2989, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the flooring.  The smooth curves of the vase work great in this shot.  Very well done!</td>', 'I love the lighting and the flooring.  The smooth curves of the vase work great in this shot.  Very well done!', '2002-10-24 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143993, 7212, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent photo.. i love the color and lighting here... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent photo.. i love the color and lighting here... great work :) - setzler', '2002-10-24 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143994, 7212, 811, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why, but htis photo really appeals to me.  I like the negative space, and the green is wonderful.  Great work. karmat</td>', 'I am not sure why, but htis photo really appeals to me.  I like the negative space, and the green is wonderful.  Great work. karmat', '2002-10-24 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143995, 7212, 3575, '<td valign="top">10 - nothing else to say. joanns -- ok, I''ll say something. I love the vase, the curves in it are wonderful. The colors are supurb, like a beautiful soft flower. Then there''s the shadow cast by the vase and your light source. It''s wonderful. The exposure you used (would like to know your settings) makes the vase soft, muted yet still incredible colors. The surface you used looks like marble -- its a wonderful choice and finally, your placement of the object is perfection. Thank you!</td>', '10 - nothing else to say. joanns -- ok, I''ll say something. I love the vase, the curves in it are wonderful. The colors are supurb, like a beautiful soft flower. Then there''s the shadow cast by the vase and your light source. It''s wonderful. The exposure you used (would like to know your settings) makes the vase soft, muted yet still incredible colors. The surface you used looks like marble -- its a wonderful choice and finally, your placement of the object is perfection. Thank you!', '2002-10-24 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143996, 7212, 2527, '<td valign="top">Good colors! <br/>i like your pic!<br/>Did you tried over a black blanket instead of the floor?Good luck!<br/>Richi</td>', 'Good colors! i like your pic!Did you tried over a black blanket instead of the floor?Good luck!Richi', '2002-10-25 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143997, 7212, 2472, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image</td>', 'Beautiful image', '2002-10-25 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143998, 7212, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2002-10-26 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
