(144004, 7214, 3080, '<td valign="top">Quite interesting.  I like the lighting.  Works well here.  I also like the light that has been thrown into the background.  The glow of the shell works nicely.  Focus is nice and the angle and framing/cropping are also well done.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Quite interesting.  I like the lighting.  Works well here.  I also like the light that has been thrown into the background.  The glow of the shell works nicely.  Focus is nice and the angle and framing/cropping are also well done.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144005, 7214, 3032, '<td valign="top">Unsharp/ out of focus.</td>', 'Unsharp/ out of focus.', '2002-10-21 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144006, 7214, 4564, '<td valign="top">nicelly shot. nice framing. nice use of lighting. 6</td>', 'nicelly shot. nice framing. nice use of lighting. 6', '2002-10-21 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144007, 7214, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light and the subject choice. Whatever that is in the bg adds interest and is a nice addition. My big problem with the shot is that it seems so soft. If you chose for it to be that way then I would like to know why. I would just like it SO much more in sharp focus. ~indigo997</td>', 'I like the use of light and the subject choice. Whatever that is in the bg adds interest and is a nice addition. My big problem with the shot is that it seems so soft. If you chose for it to be that way then I would like to know why. I would just like it SO much more in sharp focus. ~indigo997', '2002-10-22 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144008, 7214, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct (exposure, focus, etc.) 6<br/>Good composition.  6<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood 5<br/>High impact to the viewer 5<br/>Exemplifies the theme of the Challenge 7<br/>overall 6<br/>Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct (exposure, focus, etc.) 6Good composition.  6Tells a story or creates a mood 5High impact to the viewer 5Exemplifies the theme of the Challenge 7overall 6Sulamk', '2002-10-22 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
