(144030, 7215, 3247, '<td valign="top">Such pure colors!  I like works with glass.  Good shot.</td>', 'Such pure colors!  I like works with glass.  Good shot.', '2002-10-22 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144031, 7215, 2667, '<td valign="top">wonderful study of light and color...great movement in this piece and compositionally quite strong.  ~mcmurma</td>', 'wonderful study of light and color...great movement in this piece and compositionally quite strong.  ~mcmurma', '2002-10-23 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144032, 7215, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice, and your lighting really makes the photo great.  Not sure what this is, but it''s cool.  Your focus is very nice.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I love the colors in this.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice, and your lighting really makes the photo great.  Not sure what this is, but it''s cool.  Your focus is very nice.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-24 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144033, 7215, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very nice bright colours. Only downside is the reflection of the torch (the dark ring).</td>', 'Very nice bright colours. Only downside is the reflection of the torch (the dark ring).', '2002-10-24 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144034, 7215, 3575, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. The colors are beautifully vibrant. I don''t really know what I''m looking at as far as the lighting effect but it looks like it took some work to accomplish. Could you have used lasers? Well, for keeping my interest - 8</td>', 'Nice abstract. The colors are beautifully vibrant. I don''t really know what I''m looking at as far as the lighting effect but it looks like it took some work to accomplish. Could you have used lasers? Well, for keeping my interest - 8', '2002-10-24 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144035, 7215, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is really neat, very imaginative. I love your colors.</td>', 'This is really neat, very imaginative. I love your colors.', '2002-10-25 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144036, 7215, 3540, '<td valign="top">Love the nice bright colors.  I''m not so sure the lighting is necessarily dramatic though.  Good shot nonetheless, just maybe for a different challenge more than this one.  Good luck! - Inspzil<br/></td>', 'Love the nice bright colors.  I''m not so sure the lighting is necessarily dramatic though.  Good shot nonetheless, just maybe for a different challenge more than this one.  Good luck! - Inspzil', '2002-10-25 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
