(144249, 7241, 3936, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  The gourd on the upper left, (no idea what it''s called) comes out too hot.  The detail in the neck at the stem is completeluy gone.  Perhaps if you had let more of the scene go darker, for more drama...  7</td>', 'Interesting composition.  The gourd on the upper left, (no idea what it''s called) comes out too hot.  The detail in the neck at the stem is completeluy gone.  Perhaps if you had let more of the scene go darker, for more drama...  7', '2002-10-22 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144250, 7241, 3981, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  Well done.', '2002-10-22 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144251, 7241, 4162, '<td valign="top">Sorry, dont regard candlelight as artificial.</td>', 'Sorry, dont regard candlelight as artificial.', '2002-10-22 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
