(144253, 7241, 3540, '<td valign="top">That red thing in the corner kills this picture.  It really disturbs the continuity IMO.  I really was groovin'' on the top half, but when I got to the bottom half I sort of cringed.  Sorry.  Good luck...remember, I''m only one vote - Inspzil</td>', 'That red thing in the corner kills this picture.  It really disturbs the continuity IMO.  I really was groovin'' on the top half, but when I got to the bottom half I sort of cringed.  Sorry.  Good luck...remember, I''m only one vote - Inspzil', '2002-10-24 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
