(144407, 7262, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is really clever. Plasma ball? Long(ish) shutter? Nice.<br/>I very much like the way you''ve ''quartered'' it too.</td>', 'This is really clever. Plasma ball? Long(ish) shutter? Nice.I very much like the way you''ve ''quartered'' it too.', '2002-10-24 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
