(144410, 7263, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, could crop a bit tighter, good lighting. Jusitne</td>', 'Nice portrait, could crop a bit tighter, good lighting. Jusitne', '2002-10-21 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144411, 7263, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like how you used a dark background, but not so dark that the shadow wouldn''t show, as it adds to the mystery of this man. A definite dramatic photo. 9</td>', 'Very nice.  I like how you used a dark background, but not so dark that the shadow wouldn''t show, as it adds to the mystery of this man. A definite dramatic photo. 9', '2002-10-21 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144412, 7263, 917, '<td valign="top">Mean, moody, magnificent. I''d like to see this in portrait rather then landscape, as it reminds me of those old portraits by Rembrandt</td>', 'Mean, moody, magnificent. I''d like to see this in portrait rather then landscape, as it reminds me of those old portraits by Rembrandt', '2002-10-21 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144413, 7263, 3447, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.         8       JEM</td>', 'Excellent portrait.         8       JEM', '2002-10-21 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144414, 7263, 4517, '<td valign="top">nice shot but his left eye looks a bit odd.</td>', 'nice shot but his left eye looks a bit odd.', '2002-10-21 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144415, 7263, 4402, '<td valign="top">Should have been closer.</td>', 'Should have been closer.', '2002-10-21 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144416, 7263, 51167, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this one better if you would have just the light on his face and you couldn''t see the curtain behind him.</td>', 'I would have liked this one better if you would have just the light on his face and you couldn''t see the curtain behind him.', '2002-10-22 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144417, 7263, 2667, '<td valign="top">very strong portrait shot. I would have liked to see a little more draping in your background to carry the shadow play all the way to the right in composition. (I am sure others will say just the opposite!) very good work!</td>', 'very strong portrait shot. I would have liked to see a little more draping in your background to carry the shadow play all the way to the right in composition. (I am sure others will say just the opposite!) very good work!', '2002-10-22 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144418, 7263, 2764, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  LOTS of mood, too muted and I don''t much like the wrinkles in the sheet backdrop.they distract from the shadow cast.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  LOTS of mood, too muted and I don''t much like the wrinkles in the sheet backdrop.they distract from the shadow cast.', '2002-10-22 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144419, 7263, 3540, '<td valign="top">You didn''t have a little sign with some numbers on it he could hold up?  It''s a little mugshottish.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'You didn''t have a little sign with some numbers on it he could hold up?  It''s a little mugshottish.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-10-23 06:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144420, 7263, 2586, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Reminds me of paintings by, heck, can''t come up the name right now. 9 Journey</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Reminds me of paintings by, heck, can''t come up the name right now. 9 Journey', '2002-10-24 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144421, 7263, 4388, '<td valign="top">would look better with no lighting on te background and probably could use a little white balancing, but nice photo.</td>', 'would look better with no lighting on te background and probably could use a little white balancing, but nice photo.', '2002-10-24 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144422, 7263, 3080, '<td valign="top">He does not look happy at all to be having his photo taken.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  The backdrop is nice, although I feel that his shirt blends into the shadows a bit too much, as does his hair.   Other than that though, it is a well though out, well executed photo, your focus is very nice. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'He does not look happy at all to be having his photo taken.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  The backdrop is nice, although I feel that his shirt blends into the shadows a bit too much, as does his hair.   Other than that though, it is a well though out, well executed photo, your focus is very nice. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-24 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144423, 7263, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Focus and lighting are great. 7 waltoml</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Focus and lighting are great. 7 waltoml', '2002-10-24 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144424, 7263, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like this.  As a portrait, this really speaks to me.  If I had any kind of complaint at all, well, there seems to be some hint of fog?  I don''t know, it''s not soft focus and it''s definately not haze, but it is something.  Not that big of a thing.  9 Swash</td>', 'I like this.  As a portrait, this really speaks to me.  If I had any kind of complaint at all, well, there seems to be some hint of fog?  I don''t know, it''s not soft focus and it''s definately not haze, but it is something.  Not that big of a thing.  9 Swash', '2002-10-24 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144425, 7263, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great portrait...good use of light..reminds me of a Rembrandt painting...I would have cropped it from the left side a little and more from the right side.</td>', 'Great portrait...good use of light..reminds me of a Rembrandt painting...I would have cropped it from the left side a little and more from the right side.', '2002-10-25 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144426, 7263, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighty for the color of his skin. The background is a little distracting,  Maybe if you cropped all the background out.   good Job.<br/>Vote 7<br/>Sonifo</td>', 'Very nice lighty for the color of his skin. The background is a little distracting,  Maybe if you cropped all the background out.   good Job.Vote 7Sonifo', '2002-10-25 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144427, 7263, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. Supurb lighting. And pretty great looking "bad boy".</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. Supurb lighting. And pretty great looking "bad boy".', '2002-10-26 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144428, 7263, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very striking portrait  andrewm</td>', 'Very striking portrait  andrewm', '2002-10-27 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(144429, 7263, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting from the time of Blue Boy.  I like.  Just wish you could have gotten rid of the little bit of shadow.  Other wise real good.</td>', 'Looks like a painting from the time of Blue Boy.  I like.  Just wish you could have gotten rid of the little bit of shadow.  Other wise real good.', '2002-10-27 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144430, 7264, 1792, '<td valign="top">Might have been a little more effective just a little lighter so that the colors would stand out a little more vividly without completely losing the shadows.</td>', 'Might have been a little more effective just a little lighter so that the colors would stand out a little more vividly without completely losing the shadows.', '2002-10-21 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144431, 7264, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very creative with dramatic lighting.  Good work.</td>', 'Very creative with dramatic lighting.  Good work.', '2002-10-21 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144432, 7264, 917, '<td valign="top">Prefer a deeper depth of focus, and a more regular spacing. I like the way the middle one is picked out by the light.</td>', 'Prefer a deeper depth of focus, and a more regular spacing. I like the way the middle one is picked out by the light.', '2002-10-21 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144433, 7264, 1, '<td valign="top">Looks like the gap between blue/red is larger than the others... or is that just the angle?  It''s the only thing I see wrong.  Perhaps a bit more light is needed.</td>', 'Looks like the gap between blue/red is larger than the others... or is that just the angle?  It''s the only thing I see wrong.  Perhaps a bit more light is needed.', '2002-10-21 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144434, 7264, 4564, '<td valign="top">nice repetition. lighting  cuold have been better I think. Still very nice. 6</td>', 'nice repetition. lighting  cuold have been better I think. Still very nice. 6', '2002-10-21 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144435, 7264, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think that the focus is perfect on the green one, and as I can tell your DOF is intentional, the focus is perfect throughout the photo.  The background helps the pins to stand out a bit more.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  I like how you have them all lined up.  I wonder though why the 4 back ones are so evenly spaced, and the blue one is really far away from the red one?  Overall a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I think that the focus is perfect on the green one, and as I can tell your DOF is intentional, the focus is perfect throughout the photo.  The background helps the pins to stand out a bit more.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  I like how you have them all lined up.  I wonder though why the 4 back ones are so evenly spaced, and the blue one is really far away from the red one?  Overall a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144436, 7264, 4388, '<td valign="top">interesting.</td>', 'interesting.', '2002-10-21 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144437, 7264, 2111, '<td valign="top">what a professional job 8 Mags Coyote</td>', 'what a professional job 8 Mags Coyote', '2002-10-23 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144438, 7264, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good title.  You must be the middle child.  Overall pretty good.</td>', 'Good title.  You must be the middle child.  Overall pretty good.', '2002-10-23 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144439, 7264, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good choice of aperture, excellent use of the lighting.</td>', 'Good choice of aperture, excellent use of the lighting.', '2002-10-26 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144440, 7269, 4049, '<td valign="top">I wish only the childrens heads were visible instead of being able to see background curtains and what looks like a bear or fur on the bottom.</td>', 'I wish only the childrens heads were visible instead of being able to see background curtains and what looks like a bear or fur on the bottom.', '2002-10-21 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144441, 7269, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait of these kids!  You''ve done a wonderful job of using just one light source to exemplify 2 subjects!  Great job!  -  8-  JB</td>', 'This is a great portrait of these kids!  You''ve done a wonderful job of using just one light source to exemplify 2 subjects!  Great job!  -  8-  JB', '2002-10-21 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144442, 7269, 3080, '<td valign="top">Cute kids.  The little girl looks like Pippa from the Stephen King movie Storm of the Century.  The lighting is good.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  With the size restrictions of the site, I know it wouldn''t be legal, but outside of the challenge, I would like to see this with a bit cut off the top.  to make it challenge legal, however, I think you could crop a bit off the right to even it out and still keep the size limit.  Overall nice shot.  And wonderful models.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Cute kids.  The little girl looks like Pippa from the Stephen King movie Storm of the Century.  The lighting is good.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  With the size restrictions of the site, I know it wouldn''t be legal, but outside of the challenge, I would like to see this with a bit cut off the top.  to make it challenge legal, however, I think you could crop a bit off the right to even it out and still keep the size limit.  Overall nice shot.  And wonderful models.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144443, 7269, 3900, '<td valign="top">Did they demand an extra allowance to do this? :-)  Very nice.</td>', 'Did they demand an extra allowance to do this? :-)  Very nice.', '2002-10-21 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144444, 7269, 4297, '<td valign="top">nice portrait shot.</td>', 'nice portrait shot.', '2002-10-21 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144445, 7269, 3859, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  The lighting is beautiful and the dark background compliments those gorgeous dark eyes.  The only little thing I would change is the piece of fur material below the faces.  Because that is the only place that is shows, it is a bit distracting to me.  Wonderful job.</td>', 'I love this picture.  The lighting is beautiful and the dark background compliments those gorgeous dark eyes.  The only little thing I would change is the piece of fur material below the faces.  Because that is the only place that is shows, it is a bit distracting to me.  Wonderful job.', '2002-10-21 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144446, 7269, 327, '<td valign="top">Shining eyes...they are so cute! Nice portraits.</td>', 'Shining eyes...they are so cute! Nice portraits.', '2002-10-21 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144447, 7269, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  looks like it is bedtime.<br/>Vote 8<br/>Sonifo</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  looks like it is bedtime.Vote 8Sonifo', '2002-10-21 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144448, 7269, 2764, '<td valign="top">Great-  I wish they had both been looking wide eyed at the same point but you were probably lucky to ge them both in the shot.  Really nice lighting.  The littleguy cropped by himself would also make a great shot. 9</td>', 'Great-  I wish they had both been looking wide eyed at the same point but you were probably lucky to ge them both in the shot.  Really nice lighting.  The littleguy cropped by himself would also make a great shot. 9', '2002-10-21 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
