(144482, 7270, 3320, '<td valign="top">I think the shadow is too strong, and You should have detached the jar from the background. Nothing really interesting to mee expects the reds and browns.</td>', 'I think the shadow is too strong, and You should have detached the jar from the background. Nothing really interesting to mee expects the reds and browns.', '2002-10-22 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144483, 7270, 3859, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty jar with beautiful texture and colors.  Your light just doesn''t do enough to emphasize it.  The shadow is a nice touch, but maybe your light could have been a little closer, or perhaps brighter.</td>', 'It''s a pretty jar with beautiful texture and colors.  Your light just doesn''t do enough to emphasize it.  The shadow is a nice touch, but maybe your light could have been a little closer, or perhaps brighter.', '2002-10-22 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
