(144485, 7270, 714, '<td valign="top">I understand how hard it is to find a subject.  I looked all over my house and finally decided on a rose.  good lighting, but if a black sheet or cloth would have made the vase stand out more.  Good job.<br/>Vote6<br/>Sonifo</td>', 'I understand how hard it is to find a subject.  I looked all over my house and finally decided on a rose.  good lighting, but if a black sheet or cloth would have made the vase stand out more.  Good job.Vote6Sonifo', '2002-10-23 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
