(144520, 7272, 1143, '<td valign="top">Wow. What a brave girl! I really love this shot. Love the tone you chose. What kind of box IS that? A cat house? I like the pose and expression. A more straight-on angle might have worked to prevent some of the distracting elements like the sides of the box that show on the left bottom and along the top, but it''s not a biggie.  8  ~indigo997</td>', 'Wow. What a brave girl! I really love this shot. Love the tone you chose. What kind of box IS that? A cat house? I like the pose and expression. A more straight-on angle might have worked to prevent some of the distracting elements like the sides of the box that show on the left bottom and along the top, but it''s not a biggie.  8  ~indigo997', '2002-10-22 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144521, 7272, 2361, '<td valign="top">No doubt there will be the usual ante-diluvian comments against your photograph. I think it is a fine work and score it so.  8 Jak</td>', 'No doubt there will be the usual ante-diluvian comments against your photograph. I think it is a fine work and score it so.  8 Jak', '2002-10-22 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144522, 7272, 3724, '<td valign="top">The face, the naked body, and the menacing play of light is convincing.   The rabbit cage as a whole is less so - it appears that one could easily take that stick and batter the wire away to escape this imprisonment.    A tight crop, eliminating the white hotspot, causing the diagonal board to meet the edge of the frame  would have created more of a sense of containment.  Regardless of that,  I am still going with a 9.</td>', 'The face, the naked body, and the menacing play of light is convincing.   The rabbit cage as a whole is less so - it appears that one could easily take that stick and batter the wire away to escape this imprisonment.    A tight crop, eliminating the white hotspot, causing the diagonal board to meet the edge of the frame  would have created more of a sense of containment.  Regardless of that,  I am still going with a 9.', '2002-10-22 03:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144523, 7272, 3416, '<td valign="top">Very good image, great quality in the composition, great dramatic quality supported very well by the illumination.  Good luck in challenge. 9 jcof</td>', 'Very good image, great quality in the composition, great dramatic quality supported very well by the illumination.  Good luck in challenge. 9 jcof', '2002-10-22 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
