(144576, 7274, 4615, '<td valign="top">Good picture, not on subject.  It was ARTFICIAL light, right?  If the challenge was sunlight, or natural light, I''d give this an 8 or 9.</td>', 'Good picture, not on subject.  It was ARTFICIAL light, right?  If the challenge was sunlight, or natural light, I''d give this an 8 or 9.', '2002-10-22 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
