(144579, 7274, 2123, '<td valign="top">I''m generally not toooo much of a stickler when it comes to meeting the challenge, but it did say clearly "artificial light".  :-(  2 kathleenm</td>', 'I''m generally not toooo much of a stickler when it comes to meeting the challenge, but it did say clearly "artificial light".  :-(  2 kathleenm', '2002-10-22 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
