(144597, 7274, 3735, '<td valign="top">Ok after 33 comment I have learned two things, <br/># 1 I have learned that the sun is not a artificial light<br/>#2 I have learned to read on down the page from the words    " Challenge - Light Source"<br/>This was my first entry and i didnt read all the challenge .  Really dont know what i am doing yet , But i am having a wonderful time .                           Diana</td>', 'Ok after 33 comment I have learned two things, # 1 I have learned that the sun is not a artificial light#2 I have learned to read on down the page from the words    " Challenge - Light Source"This was my first entry and i didnt read all the challenge .  Really dont know what i am doing yet , But i am having a wonderful time .                           Diana', '2002-11-02 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(144598, 7274, 117, '<td valign="top">this image is a little bright--like the concept of the single light source--i see your after comments--the moon might have been better--good luck i am pulling for you Diana</td>', 'this image is a little bright--like the concept of the single light source--i see your after comments--the moon might have been better--good luck i am pulling for you Diana', '2002-11-11 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(144599, 7275, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up.  I like the way this looks.  The red in the back is obvious without being overdone.  Your angle and framing/cropping are very nice, and the focus seems good as well.  it MIGHT be a bit soft on the fuzzies in the very front, but it''s not a big deal at all.  The lighting works very nicely for the mood here.  Nice one! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very nice set up.  I like the way this looks.  The red in the back is obvious without being overdone.  Your angle and framing/cropping are very nice, and the focus seems good as well.  it MIGHT be a bit soft on the fuzzies in the very front, but it''s not a big deal at all.  The lighting works very nicely for the mood here.  Nice one! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144600, 7275, 1922, '<td valign="top">very beautiful photo, this would be a print that would look great framed !</td>', 'very beautiful photo, this would be a print that would look great framed !', '2002-10-21 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
