(144613, 7276, 4210, '<td valign="top">I would love this photo so much more if maybe he had wedding bands or just nothing in his palm. But still pretty cool.</td>', 'I would love this photo so much more if maybe he had wedding bands or just nothing in his palm. But still pretty cool.', '2002-10-22 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144614, 7276, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. I really like when the subject just fades into the background. Niiiiiiiice shot.  ~indi</td>', 'Very dramatic. I really like when the subject just fades into the background. Niiiiiiiice shot.  ~indi', '2002-10-22 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144615, 7276, 2764, '<td valign="top">at last it loaded - it seems dark, like the whites are grey, not white.  And the focus is off.  The pills should be in focus , no the arm hairs.  Move back and then crop in if your camera won''t focus so close. The spotlight is also off, the pills ned to be lit for be the center of attention, not the ball of the thumb.  However, ignoring the tecnical flaws, it is a powerful image, beatifully composed.  8 for effort.</td>', 'at last it loaded - it seems dark, like the whites are grey, not white.  And the focus is off.  The pills should be in focus , no the arm hairs.  Move back and then crop in if your camera won''t focus so close. The spotlight is also off, the pills ned to be lit for be the center of attention, not the ball of the thumb.  However, ignoring the tecnical flaws, it is a powerful image, beatifully composed.  8 for effort.', '2002-10-22 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144616, 7276, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great use of light &amp; shadow.<br/>That hand looks like it''s done a *lot* of work.</td>', 'Great use of light & shadow.That hand looks like it''s done a *lot* of work.', '2002-10-22 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144617, 7276, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Not to bright.<br/>Vote 8<br/>Sonifo</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Not to bright.Vote 8Sonifo', '2002-10-23 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144618, 7276, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting, great framing, great subject.... THIS is the dramatic that was asked for by the topic.  It''s so simple, but says so much.  This is for me, the most powerful image I''ve seen on DPC.  The title is great too and if you''ve kept up with all the hullaballoo in the forums dealing with titles, this one does exactly what it''s supposed to do, help clarify some things without giving a long description of what''s happening in the shot.  Thanks so much for sharing it.  12/10 - (if I could) - Inspzil</td>', 'Great use of lighting, great framing, great subject.... THIS is the dramatic that was asked for by the topic.  It''s so simple, but says so much.  This is for me, the most powerful image I''ve seen on DPC.  The title is great too and if you''ve kept up with all the hullaballoo in the forums dealing with titles, this one does exactly what it''s supposed to do, help clarify some things without giving a long description of what''s happening in the shot.  Thanks so much for sharing it.  12/10 - (if I could) - Inspzil', '2002-10-23 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144619, 7276, 2667, '<td valign="top">strong graphic shot...really like the chalky textures on the skin. good work!  ~mcmurma</td>', 'strong graphic shot...really like the chalky textures on the skin. good work!  ~mcmurma', '2002-10-23 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
