(144622, 7276, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great composition...my grandmother would love this...it would inspire a 20 minute run down of all the pills she takes :P  Nice use of your single light source...the lighting actually contributes to the mood.  Lisa</td>', 'Great composition...my grandmother would love this...it would inspire a 20 minute run down of all the pills she takes :P  Nice use of your single light source...the lighting actually contributes to the mood.  Lisa', '2002-10-24 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
