(144651, 7278, 714, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.  I like the dull color of the two bigger roses.  Still seem like it is out of focus.<br/>Vote 6<br/>Sonifo</td>', 'Very Nice.  I like the dull color of the two bigger roses.  Still seem like it is out of focus.Vote 6Sonifo', '2002-10-22 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
