(144655, 7278, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers but a little too tight for my like.  Would have pulled back a little more and left blank around the edge as frame.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers but a little too tight for my like.  Would have pulled back a little more and left blank around the edge as frame.', '2002-10-23 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
