(144699, 7283, 1037, '<td valign="top">The colour, the composition and the textures here are all gorgeous. The soft focus works really well for me. This is a very intense image. It would be interesting to see some variations on the hue/saturation of this photo, with all kinds of bizarre colour combinations. A collage of them would be really neat :).</td>', 'The colour, the composition and the textures here are all gorgeous. The soft focus works really well for me. This is a very intense image. It would be interesting to see some variations on the hue/saturation of this photo, with all kinds of bizarre colour combinations. A collage of them would be really neat :).', '2002-10-28 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
