(144703, 7284, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  I like the bubbles in the fluid.  The lighting is really nice, clear and works well for the shot.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and the overall effect of the shot is nice.  I think though that I would chose a different background. either that, or make it clear enough that we can see what we are looking at, if it is important to the shot.  Overall though, a nice photo. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very nice color.  I like the bubbles in the fluid.  The lighting is really nice, clear and works well for the shot.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and the overall effect of the shot is nice.  I think though that I would chose a different background. either that, or make it clear enough that we can see what we are looking at, if it is important to the shot.  Overall though, a nice photo. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
