(144723, 7285, 3669, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what other people say...I like photos with pets.  This kitty is well loved and this photo shows it.  The only thing that I would have done is to move the light a little over to the right so that the other side of the kitty''s face was showing more and maybe the woman should have worn a darker shirt so that her shoulder wouldn''t have been overexposed as much.  That''s just my take on it.  I really like this photo and the emotion of love for our pets. :-)  9</td>', 'I don''t care what other people say...I like photos with pets.  This kitty is well loved and this photo shows it.  The only thing that I would have done is to move the light a little over to the right so that the other side of the kitty''s face was showing more and maybe the woman should have worn a darker shirt so that her shoulder wouldn''t have been overexposed as much.  That''s just my take on it.  I really like this photo and the emotion of love for our pets. :-)  9', '2002-10-21 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
