(144827, 7291, 1078, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Like the cloudscape around the moon and the overall darkness of the photo is very supportive of the whole.  Wonder what this would look like in B&amp;W with the levels tweaked to make it a little more contrasty -- bring out the tree and foreground just a bit more.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Like the cloudscape around the moon and the overall darkness of the photo is very supportive of the whole.  Wonder what this would look like in B&W with the levels tweaked to make it a little more contrasty -- bring out the tree and foreground just a bit more.', '2002-10-22 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
