(144829, 7291, 2535, '<td valign="top">wicked!</td>', 'wicked!', '2002-10-22 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144830, 7291, 4049, '<td valign="top">That''s an awesome tree! I sorta wish the ground wasn''t lit up as much though.</td>', 'That''s an awesome tree! I sorta wish the ground wasn''t lit up as much though.', '2002-10-22 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144831, 7291, 2978, '<td valign="top">Hmmm I don''t consider moon as an artificial light source. If that so there is a light towards the tree. that means more than one light source. The photo itself is not so interesting. Should try adjust the colour to give an ambience.</td>', 'Hmmm I don''t consider moon as an artificial light source. If that so there is a light towards the tree. that means more than one light source. The photo itself is not so interesting. Should try adjust the colour to give an ambience.', '2002-10-23 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144832, 7291, 2716, '<td valign="top">Two light sources maybe?  Head lights and a flashlight?  Heck, I''m just being anal.  Love this shot.  9</td>', 'Two light sources maybe?  Head lights and a flashlight?  Heck, I''m just being anal.  Love this shot.  9', '2002-10-23 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144833, 7291, 1003, '<td valign="top">your photo is pretty cool...</td>', 'your photo is pretty cool...', '2002-10-23 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144834, 7291, 3672, '<td valign="top">really nice night phot great job! 10 smshats</td>', 'really nice night phot great job! 10 smshats', '2002-10-24 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144835, 7291, 3540, '<td valign="top">I have mixed emotions about this one.  The subject is super, that is one tree that is photogenic, if they possess such qualities.  I think the framing of the tree is mostly good, I wish the other side didn''t get cut off, but I can see why it is due to trunk position and filling the frame properly.  I don''t like where the light is placed because I think more emphasis should be placed on the cool curvy (notice the hi-tech photomographical jargon) limbs.  This is I think the challenge part of this challenge.  As it is, it''s pretty good.  It has the feeling of an oil painting, which I really like.  And I''m just sort of in the mood to talk today, so I''m sure if you aren''t getting many comments, you''ll be enjoying this one.  I was going to add the "what I would have done..." part and if it really interests you to know, PM me and I''ll tell you.  Good Luck on this challenge.  I''m finally done. - Inspzil</td>', 'I have mixed emotions about this one.  The subject is super, that is one tree that is photogenic, if they possess such qualities.  I think the framing of the tree is mostly good, I wish the other side didn''t get cut off, but I can see why it is due to trunk position and filling the frame properly.  I don''t like where the light is placed because I think more emphasis should be placed on the cool curvy (notice the hi-tech photomographical jargon) limbs.  This is I think the challenge part of this challenge.  As it is, it''s pretty good.  It has the feeling of an oil painting, which I really like.  And I''m just sort of in the mood to talk today, so I''m sure if you aren''t getting many comments, you''ll be enjoying this one.  I was going to add the "what I would have done..." part and if it really interests you to know, PM me and I''ll tell you.  Good Luck on this challenge.  I''m finally done. - Inspzil', '2002-10-24 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144836, 7291, 2752, '<td valign="top">the picture is beautiful...well composed and very dramatic(10)</td>', 'the picture is beautiful...well composed and very dramatic(10)', '2002-10-24 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
