(144838, 7291, 4005, '<td valign="top">I like this pic! Although I guess it''s no artificial light source, it''s a very very well done photo! 8 - KAOS and good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'I like this pic! Although I guess it''s no artificial light source, it''s a very very well done photo! 8 - KAOS and good luck for the challenge!', '2002-10-26 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
