(144840, 7291, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo - has a peaceful but surreal feel to it. Am I looking at the moon through the tree? If so, good eye for catching this.</td>', 'Very nice photo - has a peaceful but surreal feel to it. Am I looking at the moon through the tree? If so, good eye for catching this.', '2002-10-26 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144841, 7291, 1858, '<td valign="top">I am taking a picture of the moon through a tree, the moon is not the light source.  My flash lights up the ground before the tree and the tree itself in an otherwise very dark night.<br/><br/>raj<br/></td>', 'I am taking a picture of the moon through a tree, the moon is not the light source.  My flash lights up the ground before the tree and the tree itself in an otherwise very dark night.raj', '2002-11-02 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
