(144886, 7295, 4430, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume that the light is being reflected here.  Cool idea.<br/>2nd look:  lasar light, good pattern although a bit busy. I think a simple subject would have been better.</td>', 'I''m going to assume that the light is being reflected here.  Cool idea.2nd look:  lasar light, good pattern although a bit busy. I think a simple subject would have been better.', '2002-10-26 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144887, 7295, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking. How did you do this? I like the composition (table with rose vase on it).</td>', 'Very cool looking. How did you do this? I like the composition (table with rose vase on it).', '2002-10-26 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(144888, 7295, 3506, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the encouraging and positive comments.<br/><br/>This was taken using a 30-second shutter time and frantically waving a laser pointer in one direction for 15 seconds and then in another direction for another 15 seconds.  I "painted" the lines from behind the camera position, bother from the upper right side and from the upper left side to create a more dramatic 3D grid effect.</td>', 'Thanks for all the encouraging and positive comments.This was taken using a 30-second shutter time and frantically waving a laser pointer in one direction for 15 seconds and then in another direction for another 15 seconds.  I "painted" the lines from behind the camera position, bother from the upper right side and from the upper left side to create a more dramatic 3D grid effect.', '2002-10-28 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(144889, 7295, 3506, '<td valign="top">Oh, for those who couldn''t quite tell what the subject was...<br/><br/>White walls, white table cloth over a small table, white vase with a white flower in it.  The flower had three leaves that appear black because they didn''t reflect any of the laser light.</td>', 'Oh, for those who couldn''t quite tell what the subject was...White walls, white table cloth over a small table, white vase with a white flower in it.  The flower had three leaves that appear black because they didn''t reflect any of the laser light.', '2002-10-28 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(144890, 7296, 3859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Great use of your light!</td>', 'Beautiful.  Great use of your light!', '2002-10-21 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
