(144892, 7296, 3724, '<td valign="top">wonderful translucent effects, a little awkward yet elegant floral composition, surperb lighting,  and great seasonal colour.  I enjoy this.</td>', 'wonderful translucent effects, a little awkward yet elegant floral composition, surperb lighting,  and great seasonal colour.  I enjoy this.', '2002-10-21 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
