(145003, 7306, 3506, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot.  If it were in better focus I could rate it higher, but congratulations on a very difficult shot!</td>', 'Great candid shot.  If it were in better focus I could rate it higher, but congratulations on a very difficult shot!', '2002-10-21 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145004, 7306, 3317, '<td valign="top">woooooooooooooooow. nice action-adventure shot, definite ten.</td>', 'woooooooooooooooow. nice action-adventure shot, definite ten.', '2002-10-21 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145005, 7306, 2764, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2002-10-21 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145006, 7306, 4430, '<td valign="top">How did you get this????????</td>', 'How did you get this????????', '2002-10-21 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145007, 7306, 4564, '<td valign="top">I see the effort for the framing and originality. Unfortunatly, uninspiring to me. and framing could be better.4</td>', 'I see the effort for the framing and originality. Unfortunatly, uninspiring to me. and framing could be better.4', '2002-10-21 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145008, 7306, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting capture... definitely unique!  I don''t particularly think it fits this challenge very well...  there is nothing dramatic about the lighting when the camera flash is used as the source and hits your subject straight on.  This challenge is about creative lighting... :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting capture... definitely unique!  I don''t particularly think it fits this challenge very well...  there is nothing dramatic about the lighting when the camera flash is used as the source and hits your subject straight on.  This challenge is about creative lighting... :) - setzler', '2002-10-21 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145009, 7306, 4518, '<td valign="top">I never thought of putting out bat feeders</td>', 'I never thought of putting out bat feeders', '2002-10-21 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145010, 7306, 4648, '<td valign="top">How did nyou ever stage this one?  Good shot if it is real.  Not sure it belongs in this particular challenge. which lowers your score.  In the right challenge would be a 7-8.</td>', 'How did nyou ever stage this one?  Good shot if it is real.  Not sure it belongs in this particular challenge. which lowers your score.  In the right challenge would be a 7-8.', '2002-10-21 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145011, 7306, 4388, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2002-10-21 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145012, 7306, 4162, '<td valign="top">Is this all made out of food?</td>', 'Is this all made out of food?', '2002-10-22 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145013, 7306, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this photo.  It''s too well lit for a ''dramatically'' lit photo IMO.  The bat looks really fake.  Its not focused well either.  - Amendment 10/27 - After further review, I''ll bump you up because it''s a real bat, but the picture still doesn''t do much for me.  Plus you bothered to take the time to let me know that, which definitely counts for something in my book.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t really like this photo.  It''s too well lit for a ''dramatically'' lit photo IMO.  The bat looks really fake.  Its not focused well either.  - Amendment 10/27 - After further review, I''ll bump you up because it''s a real bat, but the picture still doesn''t do much for me.  Plus you bothered to take the time to let me know that, which definitely counts for something in my book.  - Inspzil', '2002-10-22 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145014, 7306, 1779, '<td valign="top">yikes! great capture...</td>', 'yikes! great capture...', '2002-10-22 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145015, 7306, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Tongue out and everything!  Great job!  10 Swash</td>', 'Great capture!  Tongue out and everything!  Great job!  10 Swash', '2002-10-22 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145016, 7306, 1078, '<td valign="top">Cool subject -- not what I would think to see at a hummingbird feeder.  I''m surprised at the little bit of blur since it looks like you shot with a flash.  That''s about the only thing I can think that would help -- a sharper image.</td>', 'Cool subject -- not what I would think to see at a hummingbird feeder.  I''m surprised at the little bit of blur since it looks like you shot with a flash.  That''s about the only thing I can think that would help -- a sharper image.', '2002-10-23 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145017, 7306, 3913, '<td valign="top">wow, did you really take this last week? Very Difficult it must have been.<br/>Great shot</td>', 'wow, did you really take this last week? Very Difficult it must have been.Great shot', '2002-10-23 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145018, 7306, 2716, '<td valign="top">Oh god!  Is this a real LIVE  bat?  The picture looks a bit grainy and out of focus. However,  I''ll give  you a 10 on the assumption that this was a live bat, which would make this a real tough shot to shoot.</td>', 'Oh god!  Is this a real LIVE  bat?  The picture looks a bit grainy and out of focus. However,  I''ll give  you a 10 on the assumption that this was a live bat, which would make this a real tough shot to shoot.', '2002-10-23 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145019, 7306, 3672, '<td valign="top">This picture is awsome! 9 smshats</td>', 'This picture is awsome! 9 smshats', '2002-10-24 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145020, 7306, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very challenging. I assume you used a flash. I know it would be complicated, but the way nature photographers capture night-life is through a stroboscope, or a presence activated ilumination lamp, and a fixed automatic trigger camera, avoiding the burning effects of a flash bulb. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Very challenging. I assume you used a flash. I know it would be complicated, but the way nature photographers capture night-life is through a stroboscope, or a presence activated ilumination lamp, and a fixed automatic trigger camera, avoiding the burning effects of a flash bulb. Excellent capture.', '2002-10-25 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145021, 7306, 671, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to read how you got this shot!</td>', 'I can''t wait to read how you got this shot!', '2002-10-26 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145022, 7306, 1330, '<td valign="top">is this real??</td>', 'is this real??', '2002-10-27 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145023, 7306, 4648, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the 5 now that I know a little more.  It was a tough shot.  I''ve sat for hours trying to get a good shot of humming birds.  It''s a back ache.  Wasn''t sure the bat was real, nor sure about your light.  Would fit better another challenge but after looking and thinking about it more I should have given you the 7 not the 5 I gave you.  Sorry.  There were so many to vote on and comment on I thought I''d never get through.  Don''t like to vote without telling why I voted what I did.  I think each person deserves that much.  Otherwise how will he improve and not repeat mistakes.  Again sorry about the 5.  PTL</td>', 'Sorry about the 5 now that I know a little more.  It was a tough shot.  I''ve sat for hours trying to get a good shot of humming birds.  It''s a back ache.  Wasn''t sure the bat was real, nor sure about your light.  Would fit better another challenge but after looking and thinking about it more I should have given you the 7 not the 5 I gave you.  Sorry.  There were so many to vote on and comment on I thought I''d never get through.  Don''t like to vote without telling why I voted what I did.  I think each person deserves that much.  Otherwise how will he improve and not repeat mistakes.  Again sorry about the 5.  PTL', '2002-10-28 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(145024, 7306, 3672, '<td valign="top">I''m disappointed this didn''t do better. It''s really hard to get a picture of a flying animal! I still think this is a wonderful shot! goodjob! smshats</td>', 'I''m disappointed this didn''t do better. It''s really hard to get a picture of a flying animal! I still think this is a wonderful shot! goodjob! smshats', '2002-10-28 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(145025, 7309, 51167, '<td valign="top">that is a cool shot.  I can see kinda how you did this shot I think.</td>', 'that is a cool shot.  I can see kinda how you did this shot I think.', '2002-10-21 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145026, 7309, 2978, '<td valign="top">I get the idea which is good but the settingis quite plain. The clock and the telephone are way out</td>', 'I get the idea which is good but the settingis quite plain. The clock and the telephone are way out', '2002-10-21 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145027, 7309, 472, '<td valign="top">niice : ) .. btw u should never get on top of the bed cover in a hotel. chem tests have proven there is gross stuff there : )</td>', 'niice : ) .. btw u should never get on top of the bed cover in a hotel. chem tests have proven there is gross stuff there : )', '2002-10-21 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145028, 7309, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the colors are slightly muted giving it a flat look.  Maybe some saturation (difficult with skin tones) or bumping up the contrast a bit?  karmat</td>', 'Interesting, but the colors are slightly muted giving it a flat look.  Maybe some saturation (difficult with skin tones) or bumping up the contrast a bit?  karmat', '2002-10-21 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(145029, 7309, 4564, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good idea. Unfortunatly, the lighting and especially the framing are uninspiring to me. 5</td>', 'Nice. Good idea. Unfortunatly, the lighting and especially the framing are uninspiring to me. 5', '2002-10-21 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145030, 7309, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You get to sleep around with a ghost.  Nice shot.  8</td>', 'Wow.  You get to sleep around with a ghost.  Nice shot.  8', '2002-10-21 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145031, 7309, 4648, '<td valign="top">It never ceases to amaze me the extent some people will go to just to get porn into this.  They will stretch the challenge almost to the breaking point.  Even though it is a very unique photo and I''m not sure how you did it your grade is the same.  Take this to a porn site where you might get better scores.</td>', 'It never ceases to amaze me the extent some people will go to just to get porn into this.  They will stretch the challenge almost to the breaking point.  Even though it is a very unique photo and I''m not sure how you did it your grade is the same.  Take this to a porn site where you might get better scores.', '2002-10-21 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145032, 7309, 2361, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how this is done within the editing constraints.  I''m sure there is a way; just want to know.   7 Jak</td>', 'I''d like to know how this is done within the editing constraints.  I''m sure there is a way; just want to know.   7 Jak', '2002-10-22 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145033, 7309, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here. The setting isn''t all that great. Shooting closer (cutting out most of the room) and getting rid of the ugly bedspread would help. Even just a close up of her on a pillow with part of a sheet over her - not even seeing the light - would be nice. ~indigo997</td>', 'I really like the idea here. The setting isn''t all that great. Shooting closer (cutting out most of the room) and getting rid of the ugly bedspread would help. Even just a close up of her on a pillow with part of a sheet over her - not even seeing the light - would be nice. ~indigo997', '2002-10-22 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145034, 7309, 4615, '<td valign="top">Are double exposures allowed?  I hope so.<br/>Lets assume they are then.  The light is a dramatic feature, and is not dramatically highlighting the primary subject which is the challenge.  Sorry to have to deduct points from an otherwise creative piece of work.</td>', 'Are double exposures allowed?  I hope so.Lets assume they are then.  The light is a dramatic feature, and is not dramatically highlighting the primary subject which is the challenge.  Sorry to have to deduct points from an otherwise creative piece of work.', '2002-10-22 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145035, 7309, 3890, '<td valign="top">Very clever.. nice...</td>', 'Very clever.. nice...', '2002-10-22 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145036, 7309, 4767, '<td valign="top">Shades of Duane Michels!  Well done, interestingly conceived (no pun intended!)</td>', 'Shades of Duane Michels!  Well done, interestingly conceived (no pun intended!)', '2002-10-23 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145037, 7309, 3965, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?</td>', 'How did you do this?', '2002-10-23 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145038, 7309, 3273, '<td valign="top">Obviously this was done with a slow shutter speed but how come there is no blur from moving off the bed (or is there - am I not looking close enough)?<br/><br/>Shots like this always fascinate me, simply because I don''t think my camera can do it!</td>', 'Obviously this was done with a slow shutter speed but how come there is no blur from moving off the bed (or is there - am I not looking close enough)?Shots like this always fascinate me, simply because I don''t think my camera can do it!', '2002-10-23 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145039, 7309, 1154, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! But WHY a pillow? should have used a beautiful piece of lingerie</td>', 'What a great idea! But WHY a pillow? should have used a beautiful piece of lingerie', '2002-10-23 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145040, 7309, 2553, '<td valign="top">Any memories that  I have along this line don''t include a "made" bed! And, sorry, but for me, "romantic getaway" doesn''t really fit this scene - this looks more like "Days Inn near the Motorcycle Races".  lhall</td>', 'Any memories that  I have along this line don''t include a "made" bed! And, sorry, but for me, "romantic getaway" doesn''t really fit this scene - this looks more like "Days Inn near the Motorcycle Races".  lhall', '2002-10-24 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145041, 7309, 4041, '<td valign="top">i love the effect you captured with this shot, very nicely done</td>', 'i love the effect you captured with this shot, very nicely done', '2002-10-24 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145042, 7309, 4617, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot. How did u do it? U should submit this one for this weeks challenge of ''Illusions''....i give u a 9 - vw4lyfe</td>', 'Pretty cool shot. How did u do it? U should submit this one for this weeks challenge of ''Illusions''....i give u a 9 - vw4lyfe', '2002-10-25 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145043, 7309, 714, '<td valign="top">Vote 7<br/>Sonifo</td>', 'Vote 7Sonifo', '2002-10-26 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145044, 7309, 3419, '<td valign="top">I''d be very interested in learning how you accomplished this. This looks like a double-exposure - can you do this with a digital camera? The only thing I do not like about this photo is that the lamp on the right is too bright.</td>', 'I''d be very interested in learning how you accomplished this. This looks like a double-exposure - can you do this with a digital camera? The only thing I do not like about this photo is that the lamp on the right is too bright.', '2002-10-27 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145045, 7309, 3247, '<td valign="top">Good double exposure.</td>', 'Good double exposure.', '2002-10-27 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145046, 7311, 4575, '<td valign="top">Im guessing at a long exp lit by a lazer, its a brilliant efect</td>', 'Im guessing at a long exp lit by a lazer, its a brilliant efect', '2002-10-21 05:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145047, 7311, 772, '<td valign="top">very unique concept... paganini maybe? :)  Good shot... did you, by chance, try this shot flipped horizontally?  kudos :) - setzler</td>', 'very unique concept... paganini maybe? :)  Good shot... did you, by chance, try this shot flipped horizontally?  kudos :) - setzler', '2002-10-21 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145048, 7311, 4297, '<td valign="top">not sure why this needed an administrators note... the effect has been used on several pictures on the site.. slow shutter speed with a laser projected acros the object... nicely done..</td>', 'not sure why this needed an administrators note... the effect has been used on several pictures on the site.. slow shutter speed with a laser projected acros the object... nicely done..', '2002-10-21 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145049, 7311, 3506, '<td valign="top">I see you had the same idea I had.  :)</td>', 'I see you had the same idea I had.  :)', '2002-10-21 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145050, 7311, 4372, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2002-10-21 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145051, 7311, 472, '<td valign="top">good, clever shot. the only thing i''d like to see is maybe more line density. mag99</td>', 'good, clever shot. the only thing i''d like to see is maybe more line density. mag99', '2002-10-21 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145052, 7311, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the red "dances" over the violin and brings out the details of it.  The only thing I think would have been neater would have been if you could have made the light more steady and rhythmic.  Except for more modern music (12 tone and the like), I associate the violin with steadiness and precision.  This looks frenzied to me, but, hey, what do I know?  karmat</td>', 'I like the way the red "dances" over the violin and brings out the details of it.  The only thing I think would have been neater would have been if you could have made the light more steady and rhythmic.  Except for more modern music (12 tone and the like), I associate the violin with steadiness and precision.  This looks frenzied to me, but, hey, what do I know?  karmat', '2002-10-21 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145053, 7311, 3724, '<td valign="top">Your treatment of the instrument with the laser has the effect of a bas relief rubbing......  quite good use of the entire picture plane and enjoyable subject matter.    undieyatch</td>', 'Your treatment of the instrument with the laser has the effect of a bas relief rubbing......  quite good use of the entire picture plane and enjoyable subject matter.    undieyatch', '2002-10-21 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145054, 7311, 3669, '<td valign="top">I think that if this would have been the only laser shot, I would have rated this a 10.  The laser in the one with the nude was more uniform.  I''m only counting this one down is because of the pink spots (maybe more exposed areas).  Is that a fair assessment?  Otherwise, I like the effect and the composition.  9</td>', 'I think that if this would have been the only laser shot, I would have rated this a 10.  The laser in the one with the nude was more uniform.  I''m only counting this one down is because of the pink spots (maybe more exposed areas).  Is that a fair assessment?  Otherwise, I like the effect and the composition.  9', '2002-10-21 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145055, 7311, 4564, '<td valign="top">dynamic. interesting. 7</td>', 'dynamic. interesting. 7', '2002-10-21 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145056, 7311, 4388, '<td valign="top">great composition, the best laser photo for sure.</td>', 'great composition, the best laser photo for sure.', '2002-10-21 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145057, 7311, 1779, '<td valign="top">very cool! neat picking: i wish all of the laser lines wer inside the shot. but very good.</td>', 'very cool! neat picking: i wish all of the laser lines wer inside the shot. but very good.', '2002-10-21 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145058, 7311, 4536, '<td valign="top">very nice and creative, a 10. Don''t think you needed the administrator note though.</td>', 'very nice and creative, a 10. Don''t think you needed the administrator note though.', '2002-10-21 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145059, 7311, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  I''m going to have to get out my laser pointer &amp; see what I can do.  Focus looks good, lighting is excellent, subject matter is great.  9  waltoml.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  I''m going to have to get out my laser pointer & see what I can do.  Focus looks good, lighting is excellent, subject matter is great.  9  waltoml.', '2002-10-22 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145060, 7311, 2764, '<td valign="top">Loaded finally - clever</td>', 'Loaded finally - clever', '2002-10-22 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145061, 7311, 3746, '<td valign="top">this idea has been presented better in another photo in this challenge.. still give you a 7 though</td>', 'this idea has been presented better in another photo in this challenge.. still give you a 7 though', '2002-10-22 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145062, 7311, 2667, '<td valign="top">great composition here...love the movement on this shot...evokes the frenzied bow and fret work of stringed performance. very emotive, makes me hear music. Great work!  ~mcmurma</td>', 'great composition here...love the movement on this shot...evokes the frenzied bow and fret work of stringed performance. very emotive, makes me hear music. Great work!  ~mcmurma', '2002-10-22 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145063, 7311, 3317, '<td valign="top">did somebody turn you in? of course you didn''t violate editing rules, you used an open shutter and a laser pointer, right? very very nice, if i was you i''d take the administrator''s editing disclaimer as high praise. nine for you.</td>', 'did somebody turn you in? of course you didn''t violate editing rules, you used an open shutter and a laser pointer, right? very very nice, if i was you i''d take the administrator''s editing disclaimer as high praise. nine for you.', '2002-10-22 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145064, 7311, 4049, '<td valign="top">Oo, wow that''s cool, I''ve got to get me a laser pointer!</td>', 'Oo, wow that''s cool, I''ve got to get me a laser pointer!', '2002-10-22 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145065, 7311, 3981, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture, but had it not been for the title, I would never have figured it out. However, hats off to you for the work it took to achieve this.  5</td>', 'This is an interesting picture, but had it not been for the title, I would never have figured it out. However, hats off to you for the work it took to achieve this.  5', '2002-10-23 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
