(145079, 7311, 4005, '<td valign="top">It''s a great idea, using a laser pointer to light up this violin! It looks wonderful, somehow strange, not from this earth...<br/>I love this pic and give you a 10 for it - KAOS.<br/>Note: The onliest point to criticise, I''ve got is - the top at the lower right side of the violin is missing.. and there is one part, where the lines don''t fit together - why? That''s interesting...</td>', 'It''s a great idea, using a laser pointer to light up this violin! It looks wonderful, somehow strange, not from this earth...I love this pic and give you a 10 for it - KAOS.Note: The onliest point to criticise, I''ve got is - the top at the lower right side of the violin is missing.. and there is one part, where the lines don''t fit together - why? That''s interesting...', '2002-10-27 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145080, 7311, 2079, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Ingenious idea  10 Gotcha</td>', 'Nicely composed. Ingenious idea  10 Gotcha', '2002-10-27 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145081, 7311, 4007, '<td valign="top">First shot I''ve added to my favorites.  Congrats on an awesome shot and placing.</td>', 'First shot I''ve added to my favorites.  Congrats on an awesome shot and placing.', '2002-10-28 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(145082, 7311, 2923, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.<br/><br/>As far as the shot itself, it was created using a laser pointer but the post processing with increase constrast and saturation made the lines look more "solid" than it was when the photograph was taken.  The reason is that the laser hits the violin wooden surface the reflects in different direction which makes it look fuzzy.<br/><br/>The idea was to create "sound waves" around the violin, while making the violin more VISIBLE from the laser light.  Hence the title, Interpretive Dance.<br/><br/></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.As far as the shot itself, it was created using a laser pointer but the post processing with increase constrast and saturation made the lines look more "solid" than it was when the photograph was taken.  The reason is that the laser hits the violin wooden surface the reflects in different direction which makes it look fuzzy.The idea was to create "sound waves" around the violin, while making the violin more VISIBLE from the laser light.  Hence the title, Interpretive Dance.', '2002-10-28 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(145083, 7311, 1280, '<td valign="top">Tony, You did a beautiful job creating this fine image.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Tony, You did a beautiful job creating this fine image.  Congratulations!', '2002-10-30 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
