(145128, 7318, 3540, '<td valign="top">I do NOT like your title.  But this isn''t about titles, it''s about pictures.  This is pretty well done.  I''m not overwhelmed by it, but you did a great job with the lighting.  I don''t think the subject looks like a monster, hence my opinion of the title and I think the lighting was placed in an attempt to make him look more evil.  Given a different subject, it would work very well.  But who the hell am I to say?  Good Luck on this well taken picture - Inspzil</td>', 'I do NOT like your title.  But this isn''t about titles, it''s about pictures.  This is pretty well done.  I''m not overwhelmed by it, but you did a great job with the lighting.  I don''t think the subject looks like a monster, hence my opinion of the title and I think the lighting was placed in an attempt to make him look more evil.  Given a different subject, it would work very well.  But who the hell am I to say?  Good Luck on this well taken picture - Inspzil', '2002-10-24 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
