(145164, 7322, 4584, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback guys! It was my first entry on dpchallenge. Although I was initially happy with the picture, trying to do "dramatic" lighting, I can see that the light source was much too harsh.<br/><br/>It would have looked better with a more plain, white background, and a more interesting angle to elminate the space at the sides.</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback guys! It was my first entry on dpchallenge. Although I was initially happy with the picture, trying to do "dramatic" lighting, I can see that the light source was much too harsh.It would have looked better with a more plain, white background, and a more interesting angle to elminate the space at the sides.', '2002-10-28 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(145165, 7324, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  I like the way you have the soap stacked like that.  The lighting is good.  It''s almost a bit bright on the left, but nothing serious.  Your focus is great.  I can read the labels on this soap.  Angle and framing/cropping are also well.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Nice set up.  I like the way you have the soap stacked like that.  The lighting is good.  It''s almost a bit bright on the left, but nothing serious.  Your focus is great.  I can read the labels on this soap.  Angle and framing/cropping are also well.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
