(145170, 7324, 1280, '<td valign="top">I used to make my own soap a lot, when I lived closer to the land.  This looks like my soap and I recognized it immediately without reading the label.  I never saw it with the thingy bump though! <br/>Anyway, meests the challenge and is well lit.  Good luck!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I used to make my own soap a lot, when I lived closer to the land.  This looks like my soap and I recognized it immediately without reading the label.  I never saw it with the thingy bump though! Anyway, meests the challenge and is well lit.  Good luck!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-10-27 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145171, 7326, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo... I like the composition... the lighting is not as dramatic as the subject... I was hoping to see ''dramatic'' lighting as indicated in the challenge description this week... - setzler</td>', 'This is a good photo... I like the composition... the lighting is not as dramatic as the subject... I was hoping to see ''dramatic'' lighting as indicated in the challenge description this week... - setzler', '2002-10-21 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145172, 7326, 4305, '<td valign="top">Why do people even get up in the morning???  People like this dicust me so muchi want to hurl!</td>', 'Why do people even get up in the morning???  People like this dicust me so muchi want to hurl!', '2002-10-21 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145173, 7326, 3946, '<td valign="top">I think she should have left the sunglasses off in this photo.  The refection off of them is annoying.  I would have liked to see the model''s eyes.  Otherwise, it would have been a nice catalog photo.</td>', 'I think she should have left the sunglasses off in this photo.  The refection off of them is annoying.  I would have liked to see the model''s eyes.  Otherwise, it would have been a nice catalog photo.', '2002-10-21 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145174, 7326, 4297, '<td valign="top">very slightly blurred.. the lighting is pretty standard, if somewhat dark studio lighting.. the lighting was supposed to inspire me.. it doesn''t here... not a bad shot.. its just there isn''t any WOW factor.. also, any particular reason for cropping off the top of her head?<br/>6</td>', 'very slightly blurred.. the lighting is pretty standard, if somewhat dark studio lighting.. the lighting was supposed to inspire me.. it doesn''t here... not a bad shot.. its just there isn''t any WOW factor.. also, any particular reason for cropping off the top of her head?6', '2002-10-21 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145175, 7326, 327, '<td valign="top">Hate the crop, top of her head is gone. Love the girl, the colors, composition, pose, light....great!! Jusitne</td>', 'Hate the crop, top of her head is gone. Love the girl, the colors, composition, pose, light....great!! Jusitne', '2002-10-21 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145176, 7326, 917, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the cropping.</td>', 'Not sure I like the cropping.', '2002-10-21 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
