(145178, 7326, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very well executed. Nie model. Nice pose. Only one light source? Nice use of reflectors then. Nice framing. Missing that little something to make it stand out though. 8</td>', 'Very well executed. Nie model. Nice pose. Only one light source? Nice use of reflectors then. Nice framing. Missing that little something to make it stand out though. 8', '2002-10-21 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145179, 7326, 4648, '<td valign="top">Does sex have to be in every one no matter what the challenge is.  You stretched for this one and lost points because of that on an otherwise decent photo.  Get off the family web site and go to a porn site.  Your photo ability might get a decent score then.  Pure trash.</td>', 'Does sex have to be in every one no matter what the challenge is.  You stretched for this one and lost points because of that on an otherwise decent photo.  Get off the family web site and go to a porn site.  Your photo ability might get a decent score then.  Pure trash.', '2002-10-21 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145180, 7326, 4388, '<td valign="top">would have been good for the seven deadly sins also, nice picture</td>', 'would have been good for the seven deadly sins also, nice picture', '2002-10-21 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145181, 7326, 4750, '<td valign="top">just beautiful, good job! i really like it because its simple and clear and sexy, and white is very difficult color to take pictures off , but  how every you  did a excellent job. and I would really like for you to take some pictures of my self.</td>', 'just beautiful, good job! i really like it because its simple and clear and sexy, and white is very difficult color to take pictures off , but  how every you  did a excellent job. and I would really like for you to take some pictures of my self.', '2002-10-21 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
