(145194, 7326, 4397, '<td valign="top">i like the occasional figurative image; you have a very photogenic model; the shot is rich in detail and contrast, but i really wish you had not cropped of the head that tight on the top--the rich black hair on the head might have added a good frame. enjoyed reviewing this one.</td>', 'i like the occasional figurative image; you have a very photogenic model; the shot is rich in detail and contrast, but i really wish you had not cropped of the head that tight on the top--the rich black hair on the head might have added a good frame. enjoyed reviewing this one.', '2002-10-27 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145195, 7327, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy for statue shots, but this is sure the light. Well done. Justine</td>', 'I''m not crazy for statue shots, but this is sure the light. Well done. Justine', '2002-10-21 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145196, 7327, 4388, '<td valign="top">lighting is good but is another piece of art.</td>', 'lighting is good but is another piece of art.', '2002-10-21 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145197, 7327, 3540, '<td valign="top">Just noticing this angel looks like Anna Nicole Smith.  Not that it''s bad.   I don''t like how this is lit.  It''s just lit, nothing dramatic about it.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Just noticing this angel looks like Anna Nicole Smith.  Not that it''s bad.   I don''t like how this is lit.  It''s just lit, nothing dramatic about it.  - Inspzil', '2002-10-22 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145198, 7327, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good, clear shot.  The lighting is good, but to me the point of the challenge was to "do something" with the light, create shadows, make it part of the image, that sort of thing.  O.K. I just changed my mind, up from 6 to 7.  Swash</td>', 'Very good, clear shot.  The lighting is good, but to me the point of the challenge was to "do something" with the light, create shadows, make it part of the image, that sort of thing.  O.K. I just changed my mind, up from 6 to 7.  Swash', '2002-10-22 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145199, 7327, 3965, '<td valign="top">Farrah Faucett?  Is that you?</td>', 'Farrah Faucett?  Is that you?', '2002-10-23 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145200, 7327, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful angel.  Really like the background for this one.  What ever light source you used it was soft and fairly even throughout.  Good shot.  Would like to see a larger shot to see the texture on the hands and feet.</td>', 'Beautiful angel.  Really like the background for this one.  What ever light source you used it was soft and fairly even throughout.  Good shot.  Would like to see a larger shot to see the texture on the hands and feet.', '2002-10-24 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145201, 7327, 4615, '<td valign="top">Is this the Angel of 70s style feathered hairdos?</td>', 'Is this the Angel of 70s style feathered hairdos?', '2002-10-24 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145202, 7328, 3932, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great focus and clarity.  The watch seems to be tilting a hair to the left though?  I think this would be an interesting shot with the watch being at a harsh angle.    Very nice job -   7  -   JB</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great focus and clarity.  The watch seems to be tilting a hair to the left though?  I think this would be an interesting shot with the watch being at a harsh angle.    Very nice job -   7  -   JB', '2002-10-21 03:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
