(145210, 7329, 3946, '<td valign="top">7:36 AM would have been more shocking.  I really hate it when my alarm wakes me up in the morning!!  Yes, it''s a single artifical light source, but come on.  LOL</td>', '7:36 AM would have been more shocking.  I really hate it when my alarm wakes me up in the morning!!  Yes, it''s a single artifical light source, but come on.  LOL', '2002-10-21 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
