(145213, 7329, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has very little ''subjective'' impact.  "What" you choose to photograph is very important. It''s half the battle.  "How" you choose to photograph it is the other half.  When you create a nice combination and balance between the two, you will have great shots :) - setzler</td>', 'This photo has very little ''subjective'' impact.  "What" you choose to photograph is very important. It''s half the battle.  "How" you choose to photograph it is the other half.  When you create a nice combination and balance between the two, you will have great shots :) - setzler', '2002-10-21 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145214, 7329, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composition.  Just a little clearer (sharper) would have been nice.  Would''ve been  really neat if it said 3:36 AM or something (you know when you wake up after a nightmare and you look at the time). I dunno.  Just an idea. 8.</td>', 'Great idea and composition.  Just a little clearer (sharper) would have been nice.  Would''ve been  really neat if it said 3:36 AM or something (you know when you wake up after a nightmare and you look at the time). I dunno.  Just an idea. 8.', '2002-10-21 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
