(145363, 7340, 51167, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot.  One of the best I''ve seen for the week so far.  You should try and resave this and get it as close to 150 K is you can to get rid of the little jaggies around the boy.  It would give it quite a bit more detail.</td>', 'this is a great shot.  One of the best I''ve seen for the week so far.  You should try and resave this and get it as close to 150 K is you can to get rid of the little jaggies around the boy.  It would give it quite a bit more detail.', '2002-10-21 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145364, 7340, 3946, '<td valign="top">What a feeling of loneliness.  When I first saw this photo, I thought the outlet was wrong, but now that I look at it, it fits.  Empty outlet, Empty room, Emptiness.  Dispite the feelings it portrays, it is a VERY good photo.   10</td>', 'What a feeling of loneliness.  When I first saw this photo, I thought the outlet was wrong, but now that I look at it, it fits.  Empty outlet, Empty room, Emptiness.  Dispite the feelings it portrays, it is a VERY good photo.   10', '2002-10-21 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
