(145378, 7340, 1143, '<td valign="top">Awe. How sad. I think this could be more dramatic if you could have somehow blocked the light reaching the back wall. Also, did you try diffusing the light any? It seems really hot on his head. Just a couple of technical nitpicks. Also, there appear to be a lot of artifacts on my monitor. Nice choice of subjects (seemed to be a big problem in this challenge).  ~indigo997</td>', 'Awe. How sad. I think this could be more dramatic if you could have somehow blocked the light reaching the back wall. Also, did you try diffusing the light any? It seems really hot on his head. Just a couple of technical nitpicks. Also, there appear to be a lot of artifacts on my monitor. Nice choice of subjects (seemed to be a big problem in this challenge).  ~indigo997', '2002-10-22 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145379, 7340, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct (exposure, focus, etc.) 5<br/>Good composition.  6<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood 5<br/>High impact to the viewer 5<br/>Exemplifies the theme of the Challenge 7<br/>overall 6<br/>Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct (exposure, focus, etc.) 5Good composition.  6Tells a story or creates a mood 5High impact to the viewer 5Exemplifies the theme of the Challenge 7overall 6Sulamk', '2002-10-22 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
