(145383, 7340, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very handsome composition. I would also have tried to avoid the excess light on the top of the head, in order to be able to contrast the image a little more, without burning the hair. Out of the challenge you may want to get rid of the wall contact on the lower right to make it cleaner.</td>', 'Very handsome composition. I would also have tried to avoid the excess light on the top of the head, in order to be able to contrast the image a little more, without burning the hair. Out of the challenge you may want to get rid of the wall contact on the lower right to make it cleaner.', '2002-10-23 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
