(145387, 7340, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lightinig here really helps to create the mood.  I like the darkness with the litle bit of light on his head.  I wish there was a way to get that wall socket out of there, but that''s really getting picky now. lol.  Exclelent angle and the framing/cropping are excelent.  I really like this shot, and you used the lighting to your advantage. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The lightinig here really helps to create the mood.  I like the darkness with the litle bit of light on his head.  I wish there was a way to get that wall socket out of there, but that''s really getting picky now. lol.  Exclelent angle and the framing/cropping are excelent.  I really like this shot, and you used the lighting to your advantage. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-23 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
