(145658, 7362, 2861, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t I think of this. The subject is so close to my heart. Seriously tho good photo I haven''t seen anybody do a long exposure on a fizzy drink so that you get that swirl.</td>', 'Why didn''t I think of this. The subject is so close to my heart. Seriously tho good photo I haven''t seen anybody do a long exposure on a fizzy drink so that you get that swirl.', '2002-10-21 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
