(145660, 7362, 4388, '<td valign="top">this subject would be better a littler closer and in the middle, but very nice picture.</td>', 'this subject would be better a littler closer and in the middle, but very nice picture.', '2002-10-21 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145661, 7362, 2780, '<td valign="top">Love the effect the long exposure had on the bubbles. 7 - Konador</td>', 'Love the effect the long exposure had on the bubbles. 7 - Konador', '2002-10-22 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145662, 7362, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  Oh my!  The only flaw is the irregular horizon line, or maybe the choice of tablecloth.  It looks like you could have goten some nice reflections around the base if the surface had been less bumpley,  and that dark light divide in the back should have been straight (personal peeve, I have a horror of slight;y tilted horizons)</td>', 'Oh my!  Oh my!  The only flaw is the irregular horizon line, or maybe the choice of tablecloth.  It looks like you could have goten some nice reflections around the base if the surface had been less bumpley,  and that dark light divide in the back should have been straight (personal peeve, I have a horror of slight;y tilted horizons)', '2002-10-22 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145663, 7362, 2667, '<td valign="top">really interesting light play with those bubbles! find the differences in background a bit distracting as your subject is so dramatic. Good capture!</td>', 'really interesting light play with those bubbles! find the differences in background a bit distracting as your subject is so dramatic. Good capture!', '2002-10-22 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145664, 7362, 917, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. I''d frame this centrally and zoom in a bit more so that it fills the frame.</td>', 'Excellent idea. I''d frame this centrally and zoom in a bit more so that it fills the frame.', '2002-10-22 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145665, 7362, 3181, '<td valign="top">Great Picture!</td>', 'Great Picture!', '2002-10-22 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145666, 7362, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good play on words.  Good shot of fizz, water on table, etc.  but why the off set?  Some people may like that but I don''t particularly.  Makes me tilt my head.  This cuts at least 2 points for me.</td>', 'Good play on words.  Good shot of fizz, water on table, etc.  but why the off set?  Some people may like that but I don''t particularly.  Makes me tilt my head.  This cuts at least 2 points for me.', '2002-10-23 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145667, 7362, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the motion capture of the ascending bubbles.  Unfortunately, you''ve made the same 2 mistakes I have... #1. You misspelled the title.  I did the same.  That''s what I get for resubmitting 3 different times.  #2.  It looks like it is leaning a bit.  On second thought, maybe only I made that mistake.  okay so we made only one common mistake.  I gotta go now, for some reason I''m feeling strangely thirsty - Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'I like the motion capture of the ascending bubbles.  Unfortunately, you''ve made the same 2 mistakes I have... #1. You misspelled the title.  I did the same.  That''s what I get for resubmitting 3 different times.  #2.  It looks like it is leaning a bit.  On second thought, maybe only I made that mistake.  okay so we made only one common mistake.  I gotta go now, for some reason I''m feeling strangely thirsty - Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-10-24 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145668, 7362, 3672, '<td valign="top">the bubbles fizzing to the top makes it look like somebody put hair in the drink lol! nice job 9 smshats</td>', 'the bubbles fizzing to the top makes it look like somebody put hair in the drink lol! nice job 9 smshats', '2002-10-24 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145669, 7362, 4455, '<td valign="top">this glass of beer resembles Van Gogh''s "wheatfeilds"</td>', 'this glass of beer resembles Van Gogh''s "wheatfeilds"', '2002-10-24 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
