(145722, 7367, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the round bubbles in the lamp.  The colors are really nice, and The angle and framing/cropping are also nice.  I like how the yellow kind of fades into the pink at the bottom.  Something funky is happening on the right side near the top right corner, kind of like a double figure look, however, It is not present in the rest of the shot, so I am likely to think that it is something with a reflection in the lamp its self.  Overall nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the round bubbles in the lamp.  The colors are really nice, and The angle and framing/cropping are also nice.  I like how the yellow kind of fades into the pink at the bottom.  Something funky is happening on the right side near the top right corner, kind of like a double figure look, however, It is not present in the rest of the shot, so I am likely to think that it is something with a reflection in the lamp its self.  Overall nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
