(145728, 7367, 4788, '<td valign="top">There are some things I can just never get tired of, like lava lamps! I am obsessed with them, and have been ever since the 60''s and I think this shot is superb! The colour and clarity are magnificient, and I wish you well since you''re obviously very talented! Good Luck!</td>', 'There are some things I can just never get tired of, like lava lamps! I am obsessed with them, and have been ever since the 60''s and I think this shot is superb! The colour and clarity are magnificient, and I wish you well since you''re obviously very talented! Good Luck!', '2002-10-24 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
