(145757, 7369, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like this photo!  But not for this challenge!  The dramatic lighting is here I think, but it''s absorbed into this marvelous sky.  It really isn''t contributing to the image at all.  I think you could eliminate most of the earth altogether and it will still be a very effective picture.  As much as i like the shot, it''s not good for this challenge. - Inspzil</td>', 'I like this photo!  But not for this challenge!  The dramatic lighting is here I think, but it''s absorbed into this marvelous sky.  It really isn''t contributing to the image at all.  I think you could eliminate most of the earth altogether and it will still be a very effective picture.  As much as i like the shot, it''s not good for this challenge. - Inspzil', '2002-10-24 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(145758, 7369, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, but maybe there is a lot of emphasis on natural light here</td>', 'This is beautiful, but maybe there is a lot of emphasis on natural light here', '2002-10-24 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
