(145917, 7386, 3942, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but IMHO it doesn''t work. I think you got more than enough comments so far, which are telling you, that sun is not a artificial light source. So I dont''t have to. Apart from it both the turtle and the surface are out of focus and the composition or cropping could be better. But I hope you had a good dive!</td>', 'Sorry, but IMHO it doesn''t work. I think you got more than enough comments so far, which are telling you, that sun is not a artificial light source. So I dont''t have to. Apart from it both the turtle and the surface are out of focus and the composition or cropping could be better. But I hope you had a good dive!', '2002-10-21 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
