(145936, 7388, 1143, '<td valign="top">Cool shadows. Props for all the work you did on this. Only thing that bugs me is the perspective/angle. It isn''t straight-on and makes everything seem tilted. I guess you did it on purpose, but I''d like to see a little less distortion. I think it would make the lines stand out more. 7  ~indi</td>', 'Cool shadows. Props for all the work you did on this. Only thing that bugs me is the perspective/angle. It isn''t straight-on and makes everything seem tilted. I guess you did it on purpose, but I''d like to see a little less distortion. I think it would make the lines stand out more. 7  ~indi', '2002-10-22 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
