(146037, 7395, 327, '<td valign="top">yes, and totally beautiful colors...nice.</td>', 'yes, and totally beautiful colors...nice.', '2002-10-21 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146038, 7395, 117, '<td valign="top">i like the colors in the abstact--maybe just showing the colors would have been better instead of the white on the right side or maybe a darker color there--9bobgaither</td>', 'i like the colors in the abstact--maybe just showing the colors would have been better instead of the white on the right side or maybe a darker color there--9bobgaither', '2002-10-21 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146039, 7395, 4564, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice. Great colors. Great framing. Very interesting visually. 9</td>', 'Extremely nice. Great colors. Great framing. Very interesting visually. 9', '2002-10-21 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146040, 7395, 3724, '<td valign="top">amazing image and brilliant colour.    The right edge which trails off exposing - a glass container???  disappoints my sensibility of edge to edge composition, but otherwise beautiful.</td>', 'amazing image and brilliant colour.    The right edge which trails off exposing - a glass container???  disappoints my sensibility of edge to edge composition, but otherwise beautiful.', '2002-10-21 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146041, 7395, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty.  I think I would like it even better if you had cropped out the white on the right side.</td>', 'This is really pretty.  I think I would like it even better if you had cropped out the white on the right side.', '2002-10-21 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146042, 7395, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour</td>', 'Great use of colour', '2002-10-22 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146043, 7395, 4064, '<td valign="top">It''s just lovely.  I''d like to blow it up and put it on my bedroom ceiling.  But what is it?</td>', 'It''s just lovely.  I''d like to blow it up and put it on my bedroom ceiling.  But what is it?', '2002-10-22 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146044, 7395, 917, '<td valign="top">Whenever I see abstracts like this, I''m always bothered by the stuff that goes out of focus (in the bottom right here) that seems to be the rest of the object. I''d like to be able to see the rest of the object, at least enough to be able to identify it.</td>', 'Whenever I see abstracts like this, I''m always bothered by the stuff that goes out of focus (in the bottom right here) that seems to be the rest of the object. I''d like to be able to see the rest of the object, at least enough to be able to identify it.', '2002-10-22 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146045, 7395, 3540, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect.  if you could''ve cropped out that stuff on the lower right, I''d be forced to give it at least a 9.  Very interesting.  the colors are super.  The patterns and bubbles in the glass make it very nice.</td>', 'Almost perfect.  if you could''ve cropped out that stuff on the lower right, I''d be forced to give it at least a 9.  Very interesting.  the colors are super.  The patterns and bubbles in the glass make it very nice.', '2002-10-22 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146046, 7395, 2866, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2002-10-22 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146047, 7395, 4467, '<td valign="top">I''m not an abstract fan, but I LOVE color!</td>', 'I''m not an abstract fan, but I LOVE color!', '2002-10-22 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146048, 7395, 2978, '<td valign="top">great shot!!</td>', 'great shot!!', '2002-10-23 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146049, 7395, 4388, '<td valign="top">looks like a photo of another piece of art, but I like it.</td>', 'looks like a photo of another piece of art, but I like it.', '2002-10-24 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146050, 7395, 2472, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a beautiful image</td>', 'I think it''s a beautiful image', '2002-10-24 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146051, 7395, 3080, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this without the white edge to the right.  Have the lit colors consume the whole photo.  Your angle is wonderful though.  Lots of great bright colors.  I''m not a huge fan of abstract, but when it has a purpose, it can be very nice to look at.  I like yours.  Focus and clarity are great.  I can see little air bubbles in the glass.  You show us nice detail.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I would like to have seen this without the white edge to the right.  Have the lit colors consume the whole photo.  Your angle is wonderful though.  Lots of great bright colors.  I''m not a huge fan of abstract, but when it has a purpose, it can be very nice to look at.  I like yours.  Focus and clarity are great.  I can see little air bubbles in the glass.  You show us nice detail.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-24 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146052, 7395, 2792, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2002-10-24 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146053, 7395, 4708, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat.</td>', 'Pretty neat.', '2002-10-24 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146054, 7395, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Finally an abstract that works for me.  I bit too fuzzy on the lower right hand corner.  Great colours though.  9</td>', 'Yes!  Finally an abstract that works for me.  I bit too fuzzy on the lower right hand corner.  Great colours though.  9', '2002-10-26 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146055, 7395, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like hte colors in this.  I think it might have been more effective, though, if there had been more empty space on the right, or if the colors had completely filled the frame.  Just my opinion, though. karmat</td>', 'I really like hte colors in this.  I think it might have been more effective, though, if there had been more empty space on the right, or if the colors had completely filled the frame.  Just my opinion, though. karmat', '2002-10-26 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146056, 7395, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, interesting composition.</td>', 'Nice colors, interesting composition.', '2002-10-27 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146057, 7395, 1019, '<td valign="top">This make a striking pattern  andrewm</td>', 'This make a striking pattern  andrewm', '2002-10-27 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146058, 7395, 3247, '<td valign="top">Totally.  Beautiful imagination and photo.</td>', 'Totally.  Beautiful imagination and photo.', '2002-10-27 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146059, 7396, 4077, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. Might be slightly better if the bottle was off cent(er)re, but it''s excellent regardless. seasick - 8.</td>', 'Nice and simple. Might be slightly better if the bottle was off cent(er)re, but it''s excellent regardless. seasick - 8.', '2002-10-21 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146060, 7396, 3859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like how you have turned the bottle so that the coca-cola isn''t straight on.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like how you have turned the bottle so that the coca-cola isn''t straight on.', '2002-10-21 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146061, 7396, 3672, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really great photo but could have been done from a different angle great job still ! 9 smshats</td>', 'I think this is a really great photo but could have been done from a different angle great job still ! 9 smshats', '2002-10-24 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146062, 7396, 917, '<td valign="top">Does the bottle look better turned to get the 330ml to the back? Very well done, theres none of those over bright hilites that blemish other glass images.</td>', 'Does the bottle look better turned to get the 330ml to the back? Very well done, theres none of those over bright hilites that blemish other glass images.', '2002-10-24 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146063, 7396, 4411, '<td valign="top">Good strong image, I like the way the edge of the light slants across the bottle.</td>', 'Good strong image, I like the way the edge of the light slants across the bottle.', '2002-10-24 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146064, 7396, 4388, '<td valign="top">don''t care for the composition because the glass looks like a double exposure and the labels on top of each other distract from the picture.</td>', 'don''t care for the composition because the glass looks like a double exposure and the labels on top of each other distract from the picture.', '2002-10-24 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146065, 7396, 3419, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the entire "Coca Cola" logo instead of only half plus that other text. Otherwise, nicely done photo.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the entire "Coca Cola" logo instead of only half plus that other text. Otherwise, nicely done photo.', '2002-10-27 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
