(146074, 7397, 3867, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Very dramatic.  The thumbnail didn''t get my attention but now I see it full size you did an excellent job.</td>', 'Great photo!  Very dramatic.  The thumbnail didn''t get my attention but now I see it full size you did an excellent job.', '2002-10-21 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
