(146076, 7397, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Might have been better without distraction on right side of head.  Otherwise nice.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Might have been better without distraction on right side of head.  Otherwise nice.', '2002-10-21 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146077, 7397, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Hang it on your wall. 10</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Hang it on your wall. 10', '2002-10-21 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146078, 7397, 737, '<td valign="top">Great shot, works very well in B&amp;W. Top 5 for me. An 8<br/>I would like to see a version with the face (esp right cheek) not quite as bright.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Great shot, works very well in B&W. Top 5 for me. An 8I would like to see a version with the face (esp right cheek) not quite as bright.Jim msp', '2002-10-21 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146079, 7397, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. Very thought inspiring. (9)</td>', 'Great contrast. Very thought inspiring. (9)', '2002-10-21 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146080, 7397, 4536, '<td valign="top">indeed, a ten!</td>', 'indeed, a ten!', '2002-10-21 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146081, 7397, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot almost looks like a drawing, and I mean that as a compliment.  The lighting is perfect, and the shot has a lot of impact for me.  lhall</td>', 'This shot almost looks like a drawing, and I mean that as a compliment.  The lighting is perfect, and the shot has a lot of impact for me.  lhall', '2002-10-22 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146082, 7397, 2764, '<td valign="top">got it now - 9</td>', 'got it now - 9', '2002-10-22 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146083, 7397, 4402, '<td valign="top">The hand on the head is distracting.</td>', 'The hand on the head is distracting.', '2002-10-22 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146084, 7397, 3447, '<td valign="top">A big 7.    JEM</td>', 'A big 7.    JEM', '2002-10-22 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146085, 7397, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... the hand on the head adds a very intriguing twist tho this photo :)  very nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... the hand on the head adds a very intriguing twist tho this photo :)  very nice work :) - setzler', '2002-10-23 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146086, 7397, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very good. Wonderful composition achieved with the posture of the subject. The balance between the crossed leg and the insinuated upper hand is the key. The facial expression is exact. Even if the subject may not smoke, I would have not resisted including a lit cigarret smoking on his right hand, in the same position as it stands.</td>', 'Very good. Wonderful composition achieved with the posture of the subject. The balance between the crossed leg and the insinuated upper hand is the key. The facial expression is exact. Even if the subject may not smoke, I would have not resisted including a lit cigarret smoking on his right hand, in the same position as it stands.', '2002-10-23 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146087, 7397, 3859, '<td valign="top">I like the strong contrast here.  Especially on his face.  The more  I look at it, the more I find to look at!</td>', 'I like the strong contrast here.  Especially on his face.  The more  I look at it, the more I find to look at!', '2002-10-23 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146088, 7397, 2667, '<td valign="top">very strong shot! really love the high contrast you used here. (How did you get David Carradine to pose for you, I hear he''s a really reclusive guy?) Excellent! (10)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'very strong shot! really love the high contrast you used here. (How did you get David Carradine to pose for you, I hear he''s a really reclusive guy?) Excellent! (10)  ~mcmurma', '2002-10-23 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146089, 7397, 3317, '<td valign="top">you get a ten. maybe i''m a big dummy, but i don''t know what ''hi-key'' means, perhaps you could splain.</td>', 'you get a ten. maybe i''m a big dummy, but i don''t know what ''hi-key'' means, perhaps you could splain.', '2002-10-23 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146090, 7397, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen at least one eye.  Don''t usually like B &amp; W portraits but this is pretty good.  Needs just a little less light on leg and more in middle.</td>', 'Would like to have seen at least one eye.  Don''t usually like B & W portraits but this is pretty good.  Needs just a little less light on leg and more in middle.', '2002-10-23 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146091, 7397, 4388, '<td valign="top">very interesting portrait. a little too contrasty but not much.</td>', 'very interesting portrait. a little too contrasty but not much.', '2002-10-24 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146092, 7397, 917, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. The fingers on the head stop the eye leaving the frame. Theres a tiny blemish above his elbow.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. The fingers on the head stop the eye leaving the frame. Theres a tiny blemish above his elbow.', '2002-10-24 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146093, 7397, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!  Mini-nitpick...i wish the chair wasn''t textured...it draws my eye away from the subject.  8 Lisa</td>', 'Great portrait!  Mini-nitpick...i wish the chair wasn''t textured...it draws my eye away from the subject.  8 Lisa', '2002-10-24 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146094, 7397, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice picture.  I don''t like the title of it.  I think we can tell it''s high-key, well at least I can and I don''t know squat.  But forget the title, we''re critiquing pictures here betwixt arguing in the forums.  This is a nice portrait with some pretty BRIGHT lighting, on purpose of course.  I don''t like the hand on his head.  would''ve been more effective posing in some other fashion.  But aside from that, nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a pretty nice picture.  I don''t like the title of it.  I think we can tell it''s high-key, well at least I can and I don''t know squat.  But forget the title, we''re critiquing pictures here betwixt arguing in the forums.  This is a nice portrait with some pretty BRIGHT lighting, on purpose of course.  I don''t like the hand on his head.  would''ve been more effective posing in some other fashion.  But aside from that, nice job - Inspzil', '2002-10-24 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146095, 7397, 4413, '<td valign="top">That expression, that light. Great job!</td>', 'That expression, that light. Great job!', '2002-10-24 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146096, 7397, 4615, '<td valign="top">Not so much the light source at play here as  playing around with yopu camera''s balance and contrast.</td>', 'Not so much the light source at play here as  playing around with yopu camera''s balance and contrast.', '2002-10-24 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146097, 7397, 255, '<td valign="top">i love this. and even though i am a huge fan of higer contrast pics, i still might have toned it down just a little tiny bit. but still awesome! 9--alecia</td>', 'i love this. and even though i am a huge fan of higer contrast pics, i still might have toned it down just a little tiny bit. but still awesome! 9--alecia', '2002-10-27 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146098, 7397, 1255, '<td valign="top">A bit too much contrast for my tastes, but I understand that may have been intentional.  I feel like if there was a larger range of tonal values, I could get a better look at his face and more of a texture feeling from his clothes and the furniture.</td>', 'A bit too much contrast for my tastes, but I understand that may have been intentional.  I feel like if there was a larger range of tonal values, I could get a better look at his face and more of a texture feeling from his clothes and the furniture.', '2002-10-27 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146099, 7397, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! I like this photo very much. The high contrast emphasises the details of the face and the cloths very nicely. One of my favourite photos this week. -stephan</td>', 'Wow! I like this photo very much. The high contrast emphasises the details of the face and the cloths very nicely. One of my favourite photos this week. -stephan', '2002-10-27 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146100, 7397, 4430, '<td valign="top">I know this has absolutly nothing to do with the picture itself, but I think you could have done better on the title.  I like the photo, and can see for myself that it is hi-key. 8</td>', 'I know this has absolutly nothing to do with the picture itself, but I think you could have done better on the title.  I like the photo, and can see for myself that it is hi-key. 8', '2002-10-27 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146101, 7397, 2079, '<td valign="top">Great style. I hope this does well for you.    Gotcha   9</td>', 'Great style. I hope this does well for you.    Gotcha   9', '2002-10-27 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146102, 7397, 3913, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe this didn''t win!</td>', 'Can''t believe this didn''t win!', '2002-10-28 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(146103, 7397, 3469, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your friendly comments. This past week has been a boost for my ego as a photographer,  watching the cheers and good marks coming in. I did not try to make a ''glossy'' picture that would please everyone, so I am really pleased with the way things turned out.<br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank you all for your friendly comments. This past week has been a boost for my ego as a photographer,  watching the cheers and good marks coming in. I did not try to make a ''glossy'' picture that would please everyone, so I am really pleased with the way things turned out.Thanks again.', '2002-10-28 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(146104, 7398, 4564, '<td valign="top">nice idea! watch it with the JPG compression!!! Loosing a lot of quality there. B&amp;W would have made this one better I think. 5</td>', 'nice idea! watch it with the JPG compression!!! Loosing a lot of quality there. B&W would have made this one better I think. 5', '2002-10-21 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146105, 7398, 4648, '<td valign="top">A lot of thought went into this.  I like.  Unique.  Love the colors.  Well done</td>', 'A lot of thought went into this.  I like.  Unique.  Love the colors.  Well done', '2002-10-21 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146106, 7398, 3981, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this is intentional blurring, but to me, I would have voted this an 8 or a 9 had it been sharp and clear.  Colors are good and composition is excellent.</td>', 'Perhaps this is intentional blurring, but to me, I would have voted this an 8 or a 9 had it been sharp and clear.  Colors are good and composition is excellent.', '2002-10-21 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146107, 7398, 737, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, appropriate title.  Top 5 for me. An 8<br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Nice photo, appropriate title.  Top 5 for me. An 8Jim msp', '2002-10-21 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
