(146135, 7400, 2472, '<td valign="top">I think your broken heart got out of the garbage can, and found itself a prisoner of the shadow of wrath, with a single light source as hope, obstructed by the fork from the breakfast of champions...<br/>Seriously: elegant as always, good taste and great sense of aesthetics. (the focus care is a given in your case)</td>', 'I think your broken heart got out of the garbage can, and found itself a prisoner of the shadow of wrath, with a single light source as hope, obstructed by the fork from the breakfast of champions...Seriously: elegant as always, good taste and great sense of aesthetics. (the focus care is a given in your case)', '2002-10-22 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
