(146156, 7401, 1078, '<td valign="top">Pumpkins without being pumpkins, I love it.  The composition bothers me a little, but I can''t suggest anything different based on this shot.  I think it may be a little bit too tight -- especially along the bottom.  It may also be the fact that the central "lantern" is neither centered nor very off center -- does that make sense?  Honestly, I''m not entirely sure, I''m just trying to talk out some of the things that may be causing this feeling that "bothers" me.</td>', 'Pumpkins without being pumpkins, I love it.  The composition bothers me a little, but I can''t suggest anything different based on this shot.  I think it may be a little bit too tight -- especially along the bottom.  It may also be the fact that the central "lantern" is neither centered nor very off center -- does that make sense?  Honestly, I''m not entirely sure, I''m just trying to talk out some of the things that may be causing this feeling that "bothers" me.', '2002-10-23 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146157, 7401, 4776, '<td valign="top">Dazzling</td>', 'Dazzling', '2002-10-23 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146158, 7401, 4648, '<td valign="top">Look very much like the title.  Who woulda thought to do this.    Very nicely done.</td>', 'Look very much like the title.  Who woulda thought to do this.    Very nicely done.', '2002-10-23 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146159, 7401, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the bold colors, the composition, the use of negative space, and the lighting.  What can I say?  I LIKE it! lhall</td>', 'I like the bold colors, the composition, the use of negative space, and the lighting.  What can I say?  I LIKE it! lhall', '2002-10-24 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146160, 7401, 917, '<td valign="top">Cropped a bit too much at the bottom perhaps.</td>', 'Cropped a bit too much at the bottom perhaps.', '2002-10-24 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146161, 7401, 3575, '<td valign="top">Well done. I think you cropped it a little too tightly though. I want to see the complete bulb in the center but it was cut off on the bottom. I find the crumpled, dried leaf on the stem distracting but others may not.</td>', 'Well done. I think you cropped it a little too tightly though. I want to see the complete bulb in the center but it was cut off on the bottom. I find the crumpled, dried leaf on the stem distracting but others may not.', '2002-10-24 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146162, 7402, 2978, '<td valign="top">I''m just not sure that this is a SINGLE light source.</td>', 'I''m just not sure that this is a SINGLE light source.', '2002-10-21 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146163, 7402, 772, '<td valign="top">A shot like this needs to be a longer exposure to nicely illuminate the fountains... i think you will probably get hammered here for multiple light sources... - setzler</td>', 'A shot like this needs to be a longer exposure to nicely illuminate the fountains... i think you will probably get hammered here for multiple light sources... - setzler', '2002-10-21 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146164, 7402, 117, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot but is it a single light source--6bobgaither let me know i want to score higher</td>', 'this is a great shot but is it a single light source--6bobgaither let me know i want to score higher', '2002-10-21 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146165, 7402, 4648, '<td valign="top">Your buddy beat you by having background, which added to picture.  Otherwise like it.</td>', 'Your buddy beat you by having background, which added to picture.  Otherwise like it.', '2002-10-21 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146166, 7402, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really wish that I couldn''t count at least 3  or 4 light sources here.</td>', 'I really wish that I couldn''t count at least 3  or 4 light sources here.', '2002-10-21 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146167, 7402, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  But it looks like more than a single light source to me.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  But it looks like more than a single light source to me.', '2002-10-22 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146168, 7402, 2764, '<td valign="top">looks like ice ghosts - what if you had cropped out the water all together?</td>', 'looks like ice ghosts - what if you had cropped out the water all together?', '2002-10-22 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146169, 7402, 2123, '<td valign="top">Cool, they look like feathers. :-) 5 kathleenm</td>', 'Cool, they look like feathers. :-) 5 kathleenm', '2002-10-22 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146170, 7402, 3540, '<td valign="top">I gotta think this is more than one source.  Other than that, it''s pretty good. - Inspzil</td>', 'I gotta think this is more than one source.  Other than that, it''s pretty good. - Inspzil', '2002-10-22 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146171, 7402, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  Almost looks like there are a vew light sources under there, however, who am I to say that it might not be one light source, with 3 or 4 bulbs.  Hard to tell in this case, so I''ll give the benefit of the doubt to you.  Your angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  I really like the way the water flows.  Not the light in the very front, but the one just to the left of it is a little bit bright and washes out some of the detail that we see around the other lights.  A very pleasing to look at picture. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This is very pretty.  Almost looks like there are a vew light sources under there, however, who am I to say that it might not be one light source, with 3 or 4 bulbs.  Hard to tell in this case, so I''ll give the benefit of the doubt to you.  Your angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  I really like the way the water flows.  Not the light in the very front, but the one just to the left of it is a little bit bright and washes out some of the detail that we see around the other lights.  A very pleasing to look at picture. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-24 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146172, 7402, 811, '<td valign="top">That almost looks like ice.  Very cool shot. karmat</td>', 'That almost looks like ice.  Very cool shot. karmat', '2002-10-24 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146173, 7402, 3575, '<td valign="top">1, 2, 3...don''t know if this breaks the rules but it is a terrific shot. I only wish the top of the highest water spout was more visible, it''s too dark. The spouts look like ice! I would go back to the place and work on the exposure and try to make it more symetrical.</td>', '1, 2, 3...don''t know if this breaks the rules but it is a terrific shot. I only wish the top of the highest water spout was more visible, it''s too dark. The spouts look like ice! I would go back to the place and work on the exposure and try to make it more symetrical.', '2002-10-24 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146174, 7402, 4388, '<td valign="top">appears to have more than one light source, but besides that is too dim and needs a little work in psp or ps.</td>', 'appears to have more than one light source, but besides that is too dim and needs a little work in psp or ps.', '2002-10-24 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
