(146185, 7403, 3981, '<td valign="top">It takes a very creative mind to come up with a shot like this.  Congratulations. Had the focus  been just a bit sharpet,  I would have given it an 8 or a 9. My score 5.</td>', 'It takes a very creative mind to come up with a shot like this.  Congratulations. Had the focus  been just a bit sharpet,  I would have given it an 8 or a 9. My score 5.', '2002-10-21 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146186, 7403, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus on these ants seems a bit soft to me.  The lighting works and creates really cool shadows though.  The background makes the ants and the shadows stand out nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The focus on these ants seems a bit soft to me.  The lighting works and creates really cool shadows though.  The background makes the ants and the shadows stand out nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
