(146188, 7403, 3084, '<td valign="top">One of the best this week.  Very creative and different, I like it and voted accordingly.  Good luck.</td>', 'One of the best this week.  Very creative and different, I like it and voted accordingly.  Good luck.', '2002-10-22 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
