(146190, 7403, 3317, '<td valign="top">this is a ten shot, glad you left it upside-down, they were on the ceiling, right? love that the shadows are bigger than they are.</td>', 'this is a ten shot, glad you left it upside-down, they were on the ceiling, right? love that the shadows are bigger than they are.', '2002-10-22 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146191, 7403, 3936, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the way you have captured the shadows marching across the wall(?) with the ants.  Very effective.</td>', 'I particularly like the way you have captured the shadows marching across the wall(?) with the ants.  Very effective.', '2002-10-23 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146192, 7403, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I''m not entirely sure where the focus is as none of the ants seem very sharp.  The light seems to be a mix between trying to light the whole shot and just a particular area and it doesn''t really seem to have done either very well.  Not an easy challenge, not an easy subject but at least it''s different!</td>', 'Nice idea but I''m not entirely sure where the focus is as none of the ants seem very sharp.  The light seems to be a mix between trying to light the whole shot and just a particular area and it doesn''t really seem to have done either very well.  Not an easy challenge, not an easy subject but at least it''s different!', '2002-10-23 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146193, 7403, 4648, '<td valign="top">Funny.  I just this last week tried to photograph an ant hill in the yard.  You did much better than I did.  I''ll have to give it to you for not only being able to see the ants but the awsome shadows.  This is not as easy as people may think.  "E" for effort and eight starts with "E" so that''s what I''ll give you.</td>', 'Funny.  I just this last week tried to photograph an ant hill in the yard.  You did much better than I did.  I''ll have to give it to you for not only being able to see the ants but the awsome shadows.  This is not as easy as people may think.  "E" for effort and eight starts with "E" so that''s what I''ll give you.', '2002-10-23 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146194, 7403, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.</td>', 'Nice effect.', '2002-10-23 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146195, 7403, 4494, '<td valign="top">lol, that''s bizarre.</td>', 'lol, that''s bizarre.', '2002-10-24 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
