(146209, 7407, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is something about the composition off?  The picture looks top heavy.  The lighting, however, is divine.</td>', 'Is something about the composition off?  The picture looks top heavy.  The lighting, however, is divine.', '2002-10-21 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
