(146242, 7409, 2352, '<td valign="top">There is more detail here that I look to see, but it is just a bit too dark.<br/>I like the subject and wish I could see just a bit more.  I like the mood <br/>that is set by what I can see... Extra point for the single light source.<br/>-Clicker-</td>', 'There is more detail here that I look to see, but it is just a bit too dark.I like the subject and wish I could see just a bit more.  I like the mood that is set by what I can see... Extra point for the single light source.-Clicker-', '2002-10-23 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
