(146268, 7410, 3942, '<td valign="top">WOW, this one makes me voiceless. This shot is breathtaking beautiful! Please tell me some more details after the voting is over. How did you get the light stripes so nearly parallel? By hand? Good luck for the challenge an thanx a lot for letting me see this shot! - nds voted 11 :-)</td>', 'WOW, this one makes me voiceless. This shot is breathtaking beautiful! Please tell me some more details after the voting is over. How did you get the light stripes so nearly parallel? By hand? Good luck for the challenge an thanx a lot for letting me see this shot! - nds voted 11 :-)', '2002-10-21 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
