(146272, 7410, 1143, '<td valign="top">AWESOME shot! My favorite of the laser photos. You did an excellent job. Personally, I would rather see it cropped a little higher, but otherwise it''s just great.  10  ~indigo997</td>', 'AWESOME shot! My favorite of the laser photos. You did an excellent job. Personally, I would rather see it cropped a little higher, but otherwise it''s just great.  10  ~indigo997', '2002-10-22 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146273, 7410, 4159, '<td valign="top">If this gets discounted for being a nude, I''ll be irked.  This is superb - 10.</td>', 'If this gets discounted for being a nude, I''ll be irked.  This is superb - 10.', '2002-10-22 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146274, 7410, 2125, '<td valign="top">very cool 10</td>', 'very cool 10', '2002-10-22 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146275, 7410, 1078, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This might sound a little strange, and perhaps it wasn''t possible to get the whole figure in for any number of reasons, but the way the body was cropped bothers me.  In some ways, I feel like this is exploiting the sex angle even more than some of the more clearly nude shots this week.  It''s hard for me to describe.  Please don''t misunderstand, it''s a great shot and I''ve scored it well -- there''s just something about it that bothers me and I''m having a hard time putting it into words.  If you''d like to chat about what I mean after the challenge, get in touch with me.</td>', 'Very nice.  This might sound a little strange, and perhaps it wasn''t possible to get the whole figure in for any number of reasons, but the way the body was cropped bothers me.  In some ways, I feel like this is exploiting the sex angle even more than some of the more clearly nude shots this week.  It''s hard for me to describe.  Please don''t misunderstand, it''s a great shot and I''ve scored it well -- there''s just something about it that bothers me and I''m having a hard time putting it into words.  If you''d like to chat about what I mean after the challenge, get in touch with me.', '2002-10-22 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
