(146277, 7410, 4758, '<td valign="top">A very good use of artificial lights. The picture tells the viewer right away that the photographer has really put his mind to it. I sure would like to know what type of lightning he/she has used for this shot.</td>', 'A very good use of artificial lights. The picture tells the viewer right away that the photographer has really put his mind to it. I sure would like to know what type of lightning he/she has used for this shot.', '2002-10-22 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
