(146311, 7410, 3604, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments.  I spent close to 20 hours researching, testing and producing this shot and everyone''s response to it was quite gratifying.  I''m trying to figure out how to do the mini-tutorial that some have asked for but there may be too much nudity in my out-takes to be viable.  PM me if you have specific questions and I''ll do my best to help.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments.  I spent close to 20 hours researching, testing and producing this shot and everyone''s response to it was quite gratifying.  I''m trying to figure out how to do the mini-tutorial that some have asked for but there may be too much nudity in my out-takes to be viable.  PM me if you have specific questions and I''ll do my best to help.', '2002-10-28 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
