(146382, 7416, 3932, '<td valign="top">Wow... great idea.  The lighting is very subtle on your hands, which works quite well.  My only real gripe, would be that your right hand is a bit higher than your left hand.  The lightbulb is nicely centered, not off-kilter to the left or right that I can tell.  Very nice detail on the hands.  Good clarity and focus.  - 9  -  JB</td>', 'Wow... great idea.  The lighting is very subtle on your hands, which works quite well.  My only real gripe, would be that your right hand is a bit higher than your left hand.  The lightbulb is nicely centered, not off-kilter to the left or right that I can tell.  Very nice detail on the hands.  Good clarity and focus.  - 9  -  JB', '2002-10-21 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
