(146413, 7416, 4410, '<td valign="top">This is my all time favorite in the challenge.  Great idea ...Something turned on in your head and all you needed was to transfer it into the work of your hands...good job</td>', 'This is my all time favorite in the challenge.  Great idea ...Something turned on in your head and all you needed was to transfer it into the work of your hands...good job', '2002-10-27 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
