(146518, 7424, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ooooh - I just voted on a run of low scorers - This is really nice-  I like a lot of things.  Of course the lighting is perfect.  But also the composition is nicely balanced and the colors are great together,  The textures of the shell contrast with whatever the fabric that it sits on is.  And I like the focus very much, esp how hit fades out at the top and how it is very sharp unde the shell.  In fact, as I look at it I think the focus of the picture, where your eye gets drawn to by the likes of the shell and the lines of the shadow is the line of light just under the shell, like something is waiting to come out there.  Really nice!  (sorry, I didn''t mean to write a book)</td>', 'Ooooh - I just voted on a run of low scorers - This is really nice-  I like a lot of things.  Of course the lighting is perfect.  But also the composition is nicely balanced and the colors are great together,  The textures of the shell contrast with whatever the fabric that it sits on is.  And I like the focus very much, esp how hit fades out at the top and how it is very sharp unde the shell.  In fact, as I look at it I think the focus of the picture, where your eye gets drawn to by the likes of the shell and the lines of the shadow is the line of light just under the shell, like something is waiting to come out there.  Really nice!  (sorry, I didn''t mean to write a book)', '2002-10-21 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146519, 7424, 1922, '<td valign="top">very artistic, great use of light</td>', 'very artistic, great use of light', '2002-10-21 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146520, 7424, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very well done. great textures. uninspiring to me. 7</td>', 'Very well done. great textures. uninspiring to me. 7', '2002-10-21 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146521, 7424, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The glow and shadow work nicely, as does the negative space at the top.  A slightly larger separation between the shadow and the bottom of the frame might have helped the shot.  6 wingy</td>', 'I like the idea.  The glow and shadow work nicely, as does the negative space at the top.  A slightly larger separation between the shadow and the bottom of the frame might have helped the shot.  6 wingy', '2002-10-21 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
