(146523, 7424, 1078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures, nice lighting.  Using the translucent shell was a great idea.  The ridges of light and dark across the top (looks like the fabric was slightly rippled) keep drawing my eye away from the subject.  I know it''s a small thing, but there ya go, it''s what I''m seeing.</td>', 'Beautiful textures, nice lighting.  Using the translucent shell was a great idea.  The ridges of light and dark across the top (looks like the fabric was slightly rippled) keep drawing my eye away from the subject.  I know it''s a small thing, but there ya go, it''s what I''m seeing.', '2002-10-22 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146524, 7424, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the glowing underneath the shell, it''s a warmth element to this pic.  Framing is pretty good, lighting is pretty good.  Nothing is bad, nothing is exceptional.  Good luck.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I like the glowing underneath the shell, it''s a warmth element to this pic.  Framing is pretty good, lighting is pretty good.  Nothing is bad, nothing is exceptional.  Good luck.  - Inspzil', '2002-10-22 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
