(146670, 7436, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good start to this actually, but I think if you would''ve manipulated the light a little more, you really could''ve made this awesome.  I think it''s too lit for my taste.  More shadows on the right side would''ve been good.  I would''ve tried to make the light on the hat softer as well, with a lot more shadow on the right side of that too.  And maybe have the subject give just a little hint of smile, just curling the left side lip a bit.  It would add to the ''drama''.  This is a cute shot, but I see a ton of potential here.  It is a well taken pic.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a pretty good start to this actually, but I think if you would''ve manipulated the light a little more, you really could''ve made this awesome.  I think it''s too lit for my taste.  More shadows on the right side would''ve been good.  I would''ve tried to make the light on the hat softer as well, with a lot more shadow on the right side of that too.  And maybe have the subject give just a little hint of smile, just curling the left side lip a bit.  It would add to the ''drama''.  This is a cute shot, but I see a ton of potential here.  It is a well taken pic.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-10-23 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(146671, 7436, 3317, '<td valign="top">sorry to give you a low score, it''s just that with this challenge, i think it''s supposed to be obvious that there''s only one source of light. maybe this was shot in a room with one light bulb, but it doesn''t have the war of light and shadows going on that i was looking forward to.</td>', 'sorry to give you a low score, it''s just that with this challenge, i think it''s supposed to be obvious that there''s only one source of light. maybe this was shot in a room with one light bulb, but it doesn''t have the war of light and shadows going on that i was looking forward to.', '2002-10-23 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
