(146746, 7442, 4625, '<td valign="top">Wooh, okay at first I was totaly confused, I didn''t even realize the depth of the picture, I rated it low... then I was reviewing my ratings, and WOOH! I figured it out! I thought about it three different ways, and the shadows confused me the first two ways, which lead me to discover that this was a projection of a slide (or somethign similar) onto someone''s back!! Nicely done, but I don''t think many people are going to catch on :-	10/21/2002 2:30:00 AM</td>', 'Wooh, okay at first I was totaly confused, I didn''t even realize the depth of the picture, I rated it low... then I was reviewing my ratings, and WOOH! I figured it out! I thought about it three different ways, and the shadows confused me the first two ways, which lead me to discover that this was a projection of a slide (or somethign similar) onto someone''s back!! Nicely done, but I don''t think many people are going to catch on :-	10/21/2002 2:30:00 AM', '2002-12-04 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
