(146835, 7448, 3080, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh.  With all the forum talk, this should get some laughs.  Lighting is good, focus and clarity are good.  Technically very well done.  A shame to ruin such a cute teddy though. lol.  I think I would have liked to have seen more of whatever is skewering Teddy.  not really sure if it''s a knife, or just a metal object of some sort.  Might like to have seen that a little clearer, otherwise, a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This made me laugh.  With all the forum talk, this should get some laughs.  Lighting is good, focus and clarity are good.  Technically very well done.  A shame to ruin such a cute teddy though. lol.  I think I would have liked to have seen more of whatever is skewering Teddy.  not really sure if it''s a knife, or just a metal object of some sort.  Might like to have seen that a little clearer, otherwise, a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 03:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
