(146839, 7448, 2923, '<td valign="top">Lol.  The guy in the back is Paganini, by the way :-)  I dunno, this doesn''t do anything for me.  Nice stab wound, looks like it''s a a bright red acrylic oil.  The light is too harsh IMHO.  Let''s see, i don''t like it so you should get a 1, but hey, since there is a teddy bear being stabbed, i''ll make it neutral.   5 paganini (don''t ever say i never try to be nice!!)<br/><br/>*update on second thoughts, what the hell, a stabbing teddy bear :-)  you''re gonna get bashed in your score anyway, so i am giving you a 10 to even out the average...</td>', 'Lol.  The guy in the back is Paganini, by the way :-)  I dunno, this doesn''t do anything for me.  Nice stab wound, looks like it''s a a bright red acrylic oil.  The light is too harsh IMHO.  Let''s see, i don''t like it so you should get a 1, but hey, since there is a teddy bear being stabbed, i''ll make it neutral.   5 paganini (don''t ever say i never try to be nice!!)*update on second thoughts, what the hell, a stabbing teddy bear :-)  you''re gonna get bashed in your score anyway, so i am giving you a 10 to even out the average...', '2002-10-21 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1);
