(146846, 7448, 2553, '<td valign="top">I thought this challenge was about light sources, not killing innocent teddy bears. Yes, there is a light source, but I don''t feel that it was used in dramatic, or even interesting, way.  I would have to say that I am not  at all certain what this photo is supposed to be about.  I look at photos from-(at a minimum)- the following angles: does it convey the intended message (ie: the challenge subject); is it a good/fascinating/interesting photo; would I hang it on my wall. No, No, and No. lhall</td>', 'I thought this challenge was about light sources, not killing innocent teddy bears. Yes, there is a light source, but I don''t feel that it was used in dramatic, or even interesting, way.  I would have to say that I am not  at all certain what this photo is supposed to be about.  I look at photos from-(at a minimum)- the following angles: does it convey the intended message (ie: the challenge subject); is it a good/fascinating/interesting photo; would I hang it on my wall. No, No, and No. lhall', '2002-10-24 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
