(146993, 7460, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute scene.  The deer and the torquise tree are really quite cool looking.  Focus/DOF seems very good.  The light flare on the lady deer is a tad sharp.  Did you try this with a fuller undergrowth?  (I think I have a tendancy to over do it, so this might not be a very good idea)  Score increase  -  from 7 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Cute scene.  The deer and the torquise tree are really quite cool looking.  Focus/DOF seems very good.  The light flare on the lady deer is a tad sharp.  Did you try this with a fuller undergrowth?  (I think I have a tendancy to over do it, so this might not be a very good idea)  Score increase  -  from 7 to 8.  Swash', '2002-10-23 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
