(146996, 7460, 2649, '<td valign="top">A last mimute effort that probalbly should not have been submitted (based on the scores).<br/><br/>However several folks have asked about the light source.  The light was provided by a 60 watt desk lamp.<br/>For the shot submitted, the lamp was being held in my left hand  next to the tripod,  slightly below the deer figures.<br/><br/>-np-<br/></td>', 'A last mimute effort that probalbly should not have been submitted (based on the scores).However several folks have asked about the light source.  The light was provided by a 60 watt desk lamp.For the shot submitted, the lamp was being held in my left hand  next to the tripod,  slightly below the deer figures.-np-', '2002-10-28 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
