(147084, 7467, 2472, '<td valign="top">Finding a better angle, IMHO this could provide an interesting figure that would recall a gemstone. For me, the problem for the present challenge is that you are using here more than one single source of light, by having more than one lightbulb, but that of course could be debatable, since it comes from one lamp. The clarity of focus needs more work.</td>', 'Finding a better angle, IMHO this could provide an interesting figure that would recall a gemstone. For me, the problem for the present challenge is that you are using here more than one single source of light, by having more than one lightbulb, but that of course could be debatable, since it comes from one lamp. The clarity of focus needs more work.', '2002-10-24 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
