(147164, 7473, 3080, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to see what I was looking at here.  Looks like a light shining through a key hole.  The really bright white wall to the left though leads me to believe a flash was used.  as the light coming through the keyhole wouldn''t have lit up the wall that much.  If this is the case, then there are 2 lights in this shot.  Please forgive me if I''m wrong, or email me with explaination.  Otherwise, it is really a bit dark in the dark area to tell if anything else is going on, and the ring around the light source in the keyhole doesn''t really work for me.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Took me a minute to see what I was looking at here.  Looks like a light shining through a key hole.  The really bright white wall to the left though leads me to believe a flash was used.  as the light coming through the keyhole wouldn''t have lit up the wall that much.  If this is the case, then there are 2 lights in this shot.  Please forgive me if I''m wrong, or email me with explaination.  Otherwise, it is really a bit dark in the dark area to tell if anything else is going on, and the ring around the light source in the keyhole doesn''t really work for me.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-21 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
