(147169, 7474, 2, '<td valign="top">This shot is amazing.  You''ve used your single light source to its absolute fullest potential, and your tones in this shot are brilliant.  Great job.  Please keep it up.</td>', 'This shot is amazing.  You''ve used your single light source to its absolute fullest potential, and your tones in this shot are brilliant.  Great job.  Please keep it up.', '2002-10-21 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147170, 7474, 3932, '<td valign="top">This is a wondeful shot!  The polka dots work so well with this shot being in b/w.  The transparency? of the dress with the polka dots showing through on both sides is a very nice touch.  Not fair - you always have pretty models :)  I''m undecided about the object in her left hand...?  I don''t know if a "solid" colored object would have worked better or not.  Great shot!  -  JB</td>', 'This is a wondeful shot!  The polka dots work so well with this shot being in b/w.  The transparency? of the dress with the polka dots showing through on both sides is a very nice touch.  Not fair - you always have pretty models :)  I''m undecided about the object in her left hand...?  I don''t know if a "solid" colored object would have worked better or not.  Great shot!  -  JB', '2002-10-21 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
