(147247, 7478, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like the clock, the fact that you didn''t show the whole clock makes the composition very interesting. The barely-there background is great. I like everything about this photo. joanns</td>', 'I like the clock, the fact that you didn''t show the whole clock makes the composition very interesting. The barely-there background is great. I like everything about this photo. joanns', '2002-10-24 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147248, 7478, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the old clock.  It may be art to see only part of the object and leave empty space, but I don''t see that.  Besides your empty space is not empty.  This distracts from that point.  Good clear shot of clock, maybe light source a little close and washes out too much.   Decent shot over-all.</td>', 'I like the old clock.  It may be art to see only part of the object and leave empty space, but I don''t see that.  Besides your empty space is not empty.  This distracts from that point.  Good clear shot of clock, maybe light source a little close and washes out too much.   Decent shot over-all.', '2002-10-24 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147249, 7478, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too much background in this one, even if it is blurred substantially.  I don''t think I would''ve cut off the clock either, it looks pretty cool.  The lighting is good, but I think with a blank black background (say that one 10 times fast!) it would''ve been more effective.  It is a nice shot though, don''t let me get you down about it.  Good Luck! - Inspzil</td>', 'Too much background in this one, even if it is blurred substantially.  I don''t think I would''ve cut off the clock either, it looks pretty cool.  The lighting is good, but I think with a blank black background (say that one 10 times fast!) it would''ve been more effective.  It is a nice shot though, don''t let me get you down about it.  Good Luck! - Inspzil', '2002-10-25 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
