(147251, 7478, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hadn''t seen the name "Poirot" outside a Agatha Christie novel. Then I noticed that if you crop it right below the name, it becomes one of those pictures where you can "reverse the perspective" -- it gives the illusion of being shot from below and to the right...or maybe my eyes are just too tired!</td>', 'I hadn''t seen the name "Poirot" outside a Agatha Christie novel. Then I noticed that if you crop it right below the name, it becomes one of those pictures where you can "reverse the perspective" -- it gives the illusion of being shot from below and to the right...or maybe my eyes are just too tired!', '2002-10-27 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
