(147275, 7481, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting work :)  The composition here is nice... I think that the directional lighting here works very well.  The shadow here seems to be playing a rather major role, so accenting that shadow on a lighter background could possibly make a stronger image... also, letting this shadow stretch across the floor could create a neat effect also :) - setzler</td>', 'Interesting work :)  The composition here is nice... I think that the directional lighting here works very well.  The shadow here seems to be playing a rather major role, so accenting that shadow on a lighter background could possibly make a stronger image... also, letting this shadow stretch across the floor could create a neat effect also :) - setzler', '2002-10-24 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147276, 7481, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow, but the surroundings seem incongruis to the subject.  7 Swash</td>', 'I like the shadow, but the surroundings seem incongruis to the subject.  7 Swash', '2002-10-24 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
