(147179, 7474, 2472, '<td valign="top">Sensually elegant. Classy. Vogue. I would have also tried to avoid the raised hairs on the back, unless there would have been more movement on them; as it is they seem to be simple out of place. Also, the champagne glass could have been clearer if it was pointing away from the chest, towards the light, providing a balance in the composition against the extended arm in the left.</td>', 'Sensually elegant. Classy. Vogue. I would have also tried to avoid the raised hairs on the back, unless there would have been more movement on them; as it is they seem to be simple out of place. Also, the champagne glass could have been clearer if it was pointing away from the chest, towards the light, providing a balance in the composition against the extended arm in the left.', '2002-10-23 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
