(147183, 7474, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait of a dress since the face is so dark that you can''t see it well. This is not dpc related but just wanted to comment that one has grown accustomed to a different standard for fashion photography that involves some editing, lots of editing frequently. Although the model is young and slim, the image is not entirely flattering as a fashion shoot. The lines under her chin and around her armpit would have been edited out if it were. I don''t like the light on the thumb.  The light is on the left of her body and gives a beautiful effect on her left shoulder. Yet, the pose seems to indicate  the focus of the image is on the right arm  and hand with the fabric draped over them. There''s where the light happens to be poor. 8 Journey</td>', 'This is a nice portrait of a dress since the face is so dark that you can''t see it well. This is not dpc related but just wanted to comment that one has grown accustomed to a different standard for fashion photography that involves some editing, lots of editing frequently. Although the model is young and slim, the image is not entirely flattering as a fashion shoot. The lines under her chin and around her armpit would have been edited out if it were. I don''t like the light on the thumb.  The light is on the left of her body and gives a beautiful effect on her left shoulder. Yet, the pose seems to indicate  the focus of the image is on the right arm  and hand with the fabric draped over them. There''s where the light happens to be poor. 8 Journey', '2002-10-24 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147184, 7474, 1856, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  I love the composition and black and white contrasts...great use of lighting to accentuate the contrasts.  Awesome mood :)  Are you a pro?  10 Lisa</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  I love the composition and black and white contrasts...great use of lighting to accentuate the contrasts.  Awesome mood :)  Are you a pro?  10 Lisa', '2002-10-24 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
