(4568063, 7410, 90947, '<td valign="top">Love this picture and technique.  I did the same with a white rose with similar, but far less engaging results.  You are right, LASER pointers are a problem to control.  I did my rose with quite random movements.  I like your well organized transits across the subject much better.</td>', 'Love this picture and technique.  I did the same with a white rose with similar, but far less engaging results.  You are right, LASER pointers are a problem to control.  I did my rose with quite random movements.  I like your well organized transits across the subject much better.', '2008-03-16 20:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
